<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Printed: Jul 99.</book>
  <para style="h">Xɛɛrae xa taruxui</para>
  <para style="toc1">Isa xa xɛɛrae xa taruxui</para>
  <para style="toc2">Taruxui</para>
  <para style="mt">Isa xa xɛɛrae xa taruxui</para>
  <para style="imt">Masenyi nde yi Kitaabui xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="ip">Annabi Luki naxan Inyila Isa sɛbɛ, a naxa Kitaabui firin nde sɛbɛ naxan xili «Isa xa xɛɛrae xa taruxui». Inyila Isa a masenma won bɛ Isa fe naxan nabaxi a xa simaya kui. Yi Kitaabui firin nde fɔlɔxi boore Kitaabui danxi dɛnnaxɛ, a fan a masenma won bɛ Isa fɔxirabirɛe nun a xa xɛɛrae naxan naba alako Isa xa masenyi xa yensen duniɲa birin na.</para>
  <para style="ip">Beenun Isa xa a xa xɛɛrae xɛɛ e xa a xa masenyi kawandi duniɲa birin bɛ, a naxa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ragoro e ma alako e xa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ a xa wali rabafe ma. E to na sɔtɔ, e naxa kawandi ti fɔlɔ Darisalamu. Mixi gbegbe naxa la e xa masenyi ra, e findi Isa fɔxirabirɛe ra. Kaabanako gbegbe naxa raba alako mixi xa la Isa xa xɛɛrae xa masenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na kawandi nu sɛnbɛ sɔtɔfe Darisalamu tɛmui naxɛ, Isa yaxuie naxa danxaniyatɔɛe tɔɔrɔ fɔlɔ. Na kui, Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa yensen Darisalamu fari ma. E naxa siga kawandi ti ra Yudaya nun Samari bɔxi ma. Sora singe han sora fu nun firin nde, na wali nan masenxi won bɛ. Piyɛri tide gbo na taruxui kui.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na xanbi Ala naxa xɛɛra gbɛtɛ xili naxan findixi Pɔlu ra. Beenun Ala xa a xili, Pɔlu nu Isa fɔxirabirɛe ɲaxankatama Isirayila xa diinɛ xili ra. Kɔnɔ Isa naxa a yɛtɛ masen Pɔlu bɛ, a fa a xɛɛ ɲamanɛ gbɛtɛe ma. Na kui, Isa xa xibaaru bara dangi Isirayila naaninyi ra sigafe ra bɔxie ma si gbɛtɛe nu na dɛnnaxɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔlu naxa na wali raba yire wuyaxi, keli Darisalamu han Rɔma. Yuwifie naxa a ɲaxankata ki fanyi, kɔnɔ e mu nɔ a ra. A nu kawandi tima Yuwifie xa salidee nan kui, a man nu a ti si gbɛtɛe xa salidee kui. A na raba nɛ alako duniɲa birin xa a kolon Isa bara naxan naba e bɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Na birin kui, to danxaniyatɔɛe nɔma a kolonde Isa fɔxirabirɛ singee duniɲa igirixi ki naxɛ. E xa wali xa findi misaali ra won bɛ. Ala xa won mali xaxili sɔtɔfe ra yi Kitaabui saabui ra. Amina.</para>
  <para style="imte">Isa xa xɛɛrae xa taruxui</para>
  <para style="cl">Sora</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Isa tefe koore ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Teyofilo, n bara a masen n ma Kitaabui singe kui Isa naxan birin falaxi nun a naxan nabaxi kabi a fɔlɛ <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />han a te lɔxɔɛ koore ma. Beenun a xa te koore ma, a naxa yaamari fi a xa xɛɛra sugandixie ma, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra.<verse eid="ACT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />A xa ɲaxankatɛ xanbi, a naxa mini e ma xi tongo naani bun ma, a a yɛtɛ masenma e bɛ kiraya wuyaxi a a ɲiɲɛ na a ra. A nu fa Ala xa mangɛya niini fe fala e bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />A nu e ya ma tɛmui naxɛ, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo naxa wo makuya Darisalamu ra. Wo xa lu be han Baba Ala a xa laayidi rakamalima tɛmui naxɛ, alɔ n na masenxi wo bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yaya wo xunxa ye nan xɔɔra, kɔnɔ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nan fama gorode wo ma yi saxanyi.»<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Awa, xɛɛrae to e malan, e naxa Isa maxɔrin, «Marigi, i Isirayila mangɛya ragbilenma a ra yi tɛmui nɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Isa naxa e yaabi, «Na waxati kolonfe mu na wo tan xa ma. Na natɛ na Baba Ala keren peti nan yi ra. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Kɔnɔ, wo sɛnbɛ sɔtɔma Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi na fa wo ma tɛmui naxɛ. Wo findima n ma seedee nan na Darisalamu nun Yudaya birin, Samari, han duniɲa dande.»<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />A to gɛ na masenyi tide, Ala naxa a rate koore ma e ya xɔri, nuxui fa a nɔxun e ya tode ra. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />E to nu a matoma a tefe koore ma, xɛmɛ firin naxa mini e ma, sose fiixɛ ragoroxi e ma. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />E naxa a masen Isa fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «Wo tan Galilekae, munfe ra wo tixi be wo nu fa koore mato? Yi Isa naxan tongoxi wo tagi tefe koore ma, a man fama nɛ alɔ wo a toxi siga ra ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasi ɲɔxɔɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Na xanbi e naxa gbilen Darisalamu, kelife geya ma naxan xili Oliwi geya. Kelife na geya ma han Darisalamu, yaamilɛ keren na a ra. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />E naxa so koore banxi kui, e nu darixi e malan na dɛnnaxɛ. Naxee nu na na: Piyɛri, Yaya, Yaki, Andire, Filipu, Tomasi, Barotolome, Matiyu, Yaki Alifa xa di, Simɔn naxan findi Seloti ra, nun Yudasi, Yaki xa di. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />E birin nu Ala maxandima ɲanige keren na, e nun ginɛe, a nun Mariyama, Isa nga, a nun Isa xunyae.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Lɔxɔ nde Piyɛri naxa keli, a ti a ngaxakerenyie tagi. Mixi kɛmɛ mixi mɔxɔɲɛn ɲɔndɔn nu malanxi naa. A naxa a fala e bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />«N ngaxakerenyie, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxan masenxi Kitaabui kui Dawuda saabui ra, Yudasi xa fe ra, naxan ti mixie ya ra Isa suxufe ma, na birin bara kamali. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />A nu na muxu tan xɛɛrae nan ya ma. Muxu birin nan nu xɛɛra wali rabama. <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />E naxa bɔxi sara yi xɛmɛ xa fe kobi rabaxi sare ra. Yudasi naxa faxa mɛnni, a bira, a furi bula, a furingɛe naxa mini a ra. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Darisalamukae birin naxa yi fe kolon. E naxa na bɔxi xili fala Akeledama, na nan falaxi e xa xui ‹Wuli Bɔxi›.»<verse eid="ACT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />«A sɛbɛxi Yabura Dawuda kui, ‹A xa banxi xa balan, mixi yo naxa sabati naa.› A man sɛbɛxi, ‹Xɛɛra gbɛtɛ xa ti a ɲɔxɔɛ ra.› <verse eid="ACT 1:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21-22" />Awa na kui, a lanma xɛmɛ keren xa sugandi naxan nɔma muxu malide seedeya rabade Isa xa marakeli xa fe ra. A lanma won xa mixi sugandi naxan nu na won ya ma, won nun Marigi Isa to nu a ra, kelife Yaya Isa xunxa ye xɔɔra tɛmui naxɛ, han Isa te koore ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />E naxa mixi firin masen: Yusufu naxan nu xili Barasaba, e man nu naxan xili falama Yusutu, a nun Matiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Na xanbi e naxa Ala maxandi, «Marigi, i tan naxan birin bɔɲɛ ma fe kolon, a masen muxu bɛ i mixi naxan sugandixi yi firinyie tagi. <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />Na xa findi Yudasi ɲɔxɔɛ ra xɛɛraya nun wali rabafe ra, barima Yudasi bara siga a sigade.» <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />E naxa Matiyasi sugandi Ala xa mali ra. A naxa sa yi xɛɛra fu nun kerenyie xun ma.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi gorofe danxaniyatɔɛe ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Xɛ Xabɛ Sali to a li, Isa fɔxirabirɛe birin nu malanxi yire keren. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Xui nde naxa mini koore ma keren na alɔ foye xungbe xui. A naxa banxi kui birin nafe e nu dɔxɔxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />E naxa se ndee to naxee maniya nɛnyie ra, tɛ na e ma. Na see naxa itaxun, keren keren naxa dɔxɔ kankan xunyi ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro fɔxirabirɛe birin ma, e naxa so xui gbɛtɛe falafe Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Yuwifi diinɛlae kelife ɲamanɛ birin ma, e nu malanxi Darisalamu na saxanyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Ɲama to yi xui mɛ, e naxa fa e gi ra. E naxa kaaba barima kankan nu Isa fɔxirabirɛe xui mɛma e bari xui yati nan na. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />E dɛ naxa ixara, e fa a fala, «Pe, yi mixie naxee wɔyɛnma yi ki, Galilekae xa mu e birin na? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Won fa won bari xui mɛfe e ra di? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Paratokae, Medekae, Elamakae, naxee sabatixi Mesopotamiya, Yudaya, Kapadose, Pontu, Asi, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Firigiya, Panfiliya, Misira, Libiya, Sireni bɔxi fɛ ma, a nun naxee keli Rɔma, Yuwifie a nun mixi naxee soxi e xa diinɛ ya ma, Kirɛtikae a nun Arabue, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />won birin na e xui mɛfe won bari xui yati nan na. E na Ala xa kaabanako fee falafe won ma xuie. Na rabaxi di?» <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />E birin dɛ naxa ixara, e naxa ifu. E nu a fala e bore bɛ, «Munfe yi ki?» <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Kɔnɔ ndee naxa e mayele, e nu fa a fala, «E siisixi nɛ yi ki.»<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri xa kawandi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Na xanbi Piyɛri nun yi xɛɛra fu nun kerenyie naxa keli. Piyɛri naxa a masen ɲama bɛ a xui itexi ra, «Yuwifie, a nun wo tan naxan birin na Darisalamu, wo xa wo tuli mati n na. Wo xa a kolon, <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />yi mixie mu siisixi xɛ de alɔ wo a maɲɔxunxi ki naxɛ, barima gɛɛsɛgɛ na a ra yi ki.»<verse eid="ACT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />«Annabi Yoweli yi masenyi nan ti.<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‹Ala naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">n fama n Xaxili taxunde mixi birin na lɔxɔɛ dɔnxɔɛe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wo xa di xɛmɛe nun wo xa di ginɛe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wɔyɛnma nɛ n tan Ala xili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wo xa sɛgɛtalae to tima nɛ fee ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wo xa forie fan xiyee sa.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Na waxati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">n fama n Xaxili ragorode n ma konyi xɛmɛe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nun n ma konyi ginɛe ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">E wɔyɛnma nɛ n tan Ala xili ra.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />N kaabanakoee rabama nɛ koore ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">n tɔnxumae masenma nɛ bɔxi fari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">naxee findima wuli, tɛ, nun tuuri ra.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Soge dimima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">kike gbeelima nɛ alɔ wuli</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">beenun Marigi xa lɔxɔɛ xa a li,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na dariyɛ lɔxɔɛ xungbe.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Mixi yo naxan Marigi xili maxandima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:21">na kanyi kisima nɛ.›»<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />«Isirayilakae, wo wo tuli mati yi masenyi ra. Isa Nasarɛtika Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan nu a ra. Ala naxa na masen kaabanakoee, fe magaaxuxie, nun tɔnxumae ra, Isa naxan nabaxi wo tagi. Wo birin na fee kolon. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Ala bara a ragiri kaafirie xa kafu wo ma, alako wo xa yi xɛmɛ faxa, wo a banban wuri magalanbuxi ma, alɔ Ala nu a ɲanigexi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kɔnɔ na xanbi, Ala bara a rakeli, a faxɛ luuti ba a ma, barima faxɛ mu nu nɔma kankande a ma.»<verse eid="ACT 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />«Dawuda nu Isa xa fe nan falafe yi masenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‹N Marigi toma tɛmui birin n ya i.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">A to na n sɛɛti ma, n mu nɔma birade.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Na nan a toxi n bɔɲɛ na sɛɛwɛ kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">n dɛ fan a xa fe masenma ɲɛlɛxinyi ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">N fate fan malabuma nɛ bɔɲɛsa kui,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />barima i mu n nii bɛɲinma aligiyama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">i mu i xa sɛniyɛntɔɛ luma gaburi kui, a xa bɔrɔ.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />I bara a niya n xa kisi kira kolon.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">I sɛɛwɛ fima nɛ n ma i yire.›»<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Piyɛri man naxa a fala, «N ngaxakerenyie, wo a lu n xa won benba Dawuda xa fe fala wo bɛ. A faxa nɛ, a naxa ragata, a xa gaburi man na won tagi be han to. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Namiɲɔnmɛ to nu a ra, a nu a kolon Ala bara laayidi tongo a bɛ. Ala naxa a kali a Dawuda xa mamadi nde dɔxɔma nɛ a xa mangɛ kibanyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Na kui, Dawuda nu a kolon Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi fama nɛ kelide faxɛ ma. Ala mu nɛɛmuma a ma aligiyama, a fate mu bɔrɔma gaburi kui. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Ala nan Isa rakelixi faxɛ ma. Won birin findixi seede ra na fe ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />A to rate Ala yirefanyi ma, a naxa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ Baba Ala ra, alɔ Ala laayidi tongoxi ki naxɛ. A man bara Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ragoro won ma. Wo na nan tofe, wo na nan mɛfe yi ki.»<verse eid="ACT 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />«Dawuda mu texi koore ma, kɔnɔ a tan nan a fala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‹Marigi naxa a fala n Marigi bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">Dɔxɔ n yirefanyi ma,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />han n xa i sanyi ti i yaxuie fari.›»<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />«Na kui, Isirayilaka birin xa la a ra, Ala bara Isa findi Marigi ra, nun a xa Mixi Sugandixi ra. Kɔnɔ wo bara a banban wuri magalanbuxi ma.»<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Yi masenyi naxa ɲama bɔɲɛ tɔɔrɔ ki fanyi ra. E naxa a fala Piyɛri nun xɛɛra booree bɛ, «N ngaxakerenyie, a lanma muxu xa munse raba fa?» <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Piyɛri naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo xa tuubi, wo birin xa wo xunxa ye xɔɔra Isa xili ra, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi, alako wo xa yunubie xa xafari, wo man xa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Ala bara yi laayidi tongo wo bɛ, wo xa die bɛ, nun mixi birin bɛ a naxee xilima, hali naxee na yire makuye.» <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Piyɛri man naxa e rasi, a naxa e ralimaniya masenyi wuyaxi ra. A naxa e maxandi, «Wo wo mɛɛni yi waxati mixi tinxintaree ma.»<verse eid="ACT 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Naxee tin a xa masenyi ra, e naxa e xunxa ye xɔɔra. Na lɔxɔɛ mixi wulu saxan ɲɔndɔn naxa sa Isa fɔxirabirɛe xun ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />E nu e tunnabɛxima xɛɛrae xa xaranyi ma. E naxa lu ngaxakerenya kui. E man naxa e tunnabɛxi taami itaxunfe nun Ala maxandife ma. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Gaaxui naxa e birin suxu. Xɛɛrae naxa kaabanako nun tɔnxuma gbegbe raba. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Danxaniyatɔɛe birin nu malanxi yire keren. Xa mixi keren se sɔtɔ, na bara findi e birin gbe ra. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />E e xa see matima, e nu e harige itaxun e bore ma, kankan nu a hayi fan na kui. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ e nu e malanma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, e nu donse don e xɔnyi sɛɛwɛ nun bɔɲɛsa kui. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />E nu Ala matɔxɔma. E naxa rafan birin ma. Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ Marigi nu nde sama danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama kɔnti xun ma.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Namatɛ rayalanfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Lɔxɔ nde Piyɛri nun Yaya nu tefe hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, sali tɛmui gɛɛsɛgɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Hɔrɔmɔbanxi naadɛ ra naxan xili «Naadɛ Tofanyi», xɛmɛ nde nu na naxan nu namataxi kabi a bari lɔxɔɛ. E nu a dɔxɔma na lɔxɔɛ birin alako a xa nu kɔbiri makula mixie ma naxee soma hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />A to Piyɛri nun Yaya to so ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a naxa kɔbiri makula e ma.<verse eid="ACT 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Piyɛri nun Yaya naxa e ya ti a ra. Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «Muxu mato.» <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Xɛmɛ naxa e mato, a ɲɔxɔ naxa lu a ma e na kɔbiri nan fife a ma. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Piyɛri fa a fala a bɛ, «Gbeti mu na n yi, xɛɛma mu na n yi, kɔnɔ naxan na n yi ra, n a fima i ma. N bara i yaamari Isa Nasarɛtika xili ra, naxan findixi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra, keli, i i ɲɛrɛ!» <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />A naxa a suxu a yirefanyi bɛlɛxɛ ma, a a rakeli. A sanyie nun a sankɔnyie naxa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ keren na. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Na ikɔrɛxi ra, a naxa keli, a naxa so a ɲɛrɛfe. A naxa so Piyɛri nun Yaya fɔxɔ ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. A ɲɛrɛma, a tuganma, a Ala tantuma.<verse eid="ACT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Birin naxa a to, a a ɲɛrɛma, a Ala matɔxɔma. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />E naxa a kolon a tan nan nu dɔxɔma hɔrɔmɔbanxi «Naadɛ Tofanyi» dɛ ra kulɛ matide. Birin naxa kaaba, e tɛrɛnna yi fe ra naxan bara raba a bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />A fan naxa bira Piyɛri nun Yaya fɔxɔ ra. Ɲama birin naxa kaaba, e naxa e gi sigafe ra e yire Sulemani xa buntunyi ra.<verse eid="ACT 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Piyɛri to na to, a naxa ɲama maxɔrin, «Wo tan Isirayilakae, munfe ra wo kaabama yi fe ma? Munfe ra wo wo yae banbanxi muxu ra alɔ muxu yi xɛmɛ raɲɛrɛxi muxu yɛtɛ sɛnbɛ nan na, xa na mu a ra muxu xa tinxinyi ra? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Annabi Iburahima, Annabi Isiyaga, nun Annabi Yaxuba Marigi Ala, won benbae Marigi Ala, a bara a xa dariyɛ fi a xa konyi Isa ma, wo naxan yanfa, wo fa mɛɛ a ra Pilati ya i, naxan nu wama a rabɛɲinfe. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Wo bara Ala xa sɛniyɛntɔɛ nun a xa tinxintɔɛ yanfa. Wo man fa maxandi ti Pilati xa faxɛti nde rabɛɲin wo bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Wo bara Marakisima faxa, Ala naxa a rakeli faxɛ ma. Muxu na na fe seede ra. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Yi xɛmɛ naxan yi ki, wo naxan kolon, wo naxan toxi, a bara sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ danxaniya kui Isa xili saabui ra. A xa danxaniya Isa ma, na nan a yalanxi wo birin ya xɔri.»<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />«Yakɔsi, n ngaxakerenyie, n a kolon wo naxan nabaxi Isa ra, wo bara a raba a kolontareya ma, wo nun wo xa mangɛe. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Kɔnɔ Ala nan yi birin nagirixi, alako a xa wɔyɛnyi xa rakamali, a nu bara naxan masen waxati dangixi a xa namiɲɔnmɛe dɛ ra, a falafe a a xa Mixi Sugandixi fama nɛ tɔɔrɔde. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Awa, wo tuubi, wo gbilen Ala ma, alako wo xa yunubie xa xafari, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />alako Marigi xa fa bɔɲɛsa waxati ra, a man xa Isa xɛɛ, a bara naxan sugandi wo bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Kɔnɔ Isa, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa lu koore ma sinden, han beenun fe birin xa yailan, alɔ Ala a masen ki naxɛ a xa namiɲɔnmɛ sɛniyɛnxie kɛrɛ ra kafi a xɔnnakuye ra.»<verse eid="ACT 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />«Annabi Munsa naxa a fala, ‹Wo Marigi Ala namiɲɔnmɛ nde xɛɛma nɛ wo ma alɔ n tan. Won ngaxakerenyi nan lanxi a ma. A naxan birin falama wo bɛ, wo xa a suxu. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Naxan yo mu na namiɲɔnmɛ xui suxu, na kanyi bama nɛ Ala xa ɲama ya ma, a faxa.›»<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />«Namiɲɔnmɛ naxee birin bara wɔyɛn kabi Annabi Samuweli xa tɛmui, e birin bara yi lɔxɔɛe xa fe fala. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Saatɛ die nun namiɲɔnmɛ die nan na wo ra. Ala bara saatɛ tongo won babae bɛ. A a fala nɛ Iburahima bɛ, ‹Duniɲa birin fama hɛɛri sɔtɔde i bɔnsɔɛ nan saabui ra.› <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ala to bara a xa konyi rakeli faxɛ ma, a a xɛɛ wo tan nan singe ma, a xa duba wo bɛ, a xa kankan nagbilen fe kobie fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Piyɛri nun Yaya makiitife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Yaya nun Piyɛri to nu wɔyɛnma mixie bɛ, sɛrɛxɛdubɛe, hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɔɔri yarerati, nun Sadusenie naxa fa. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />E bɔɲɛ naxa te barima Piyɛri nun Yaya nu ɲama xaranfe, a falafe mixi faxaxie fama nɛ rakelide alɔ Isa rakelixi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />E naxa e suxu, e e sa geeli han na kuye iba, barima kɔɛ nu bara so. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Kɔnɔ mixi wuyaxi naxee na wɔyɛnyi mɛ, e naxa a suxu. Danxaniyatɔɛe xun naxa masa, han xɛmɛe kɔnti naxa wulu suuli ɲɔndɔn li.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Na kuye iba, Yuwifi yareratie, forie, nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe naxa e malan Darisalamu, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />a nun Anani sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi, nun Kayafa, Yaya, Alesandire, a nun naxee birin na sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi bɔnsɔɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />E naxa Piyɛri nun Yaya ti e tagi, e naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo nɔxi yi rayalande di? Wo a rayalanxi saabui mundun na?»<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Piyɛri naxa a masen e bɛ muxu a rayalanxi Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nan saabui ra, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />«Isirayila forie nun kuntigie, wo bara muxu maxɔrin yi namatɛ xa fe fanyi sɔtɔɛ ma, a yalanxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />Wo tan nun Isirayilakae birin xa a kolon yi xɛmɛ yalanxi Isa Nasarɛtika, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi, xili saabui nan na. Wo Isa naxan banban wuri magalanbuxi ma, Ala naxan nakeli faxɛ ma, a tan nan xili yi namatɛ rayalanxi. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Isa maniyaxi ‹gɛmɛ nan na naxan tide gbo dangi gɛmɛ birin na, kɔnɔ wo tan banxitie bara mɛɛ na gɛmɛ ra.› <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Kisi mu sɔtɔma ndende ra fo a tan, barima xili gbɛtɛ yo mu na duniɲa, won kisima naxan saabui ra.»<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />E naxa kaaba Piyɛri nun Yaya xa limaniya ma, barima xarantaree nan nu e ra. E naxa a kolon e nu bara bira Isa fɔxɔ ra a nu na duniɲa ma tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Kɔnɔ xɛmɛ to nu tixi e sɛɛti ma, a yalanxi, e mu nɔ sese falade. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />E naxa Piyɛri, Yaya, nun na xɛmɛ yaamari e xa mini Yuwifi kiitisae ya ma. E nu fa wɔyɛn e bore tagi. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />E naxa e bore maxɔrin, «Won xa munse raba yi mixie ra? Darisalamukae birin bara a kolon e kaabanako xungbe nan nabaxi. Won fan mu nɔma na matandide. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Kɔnɔ alako yi fe naxa yensen yɛ mixie ra, won xa e ratɔn a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, e naxa wɔyɛn Isa xili ra sɔnɔn.»<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />E naxa Piyɛri, Yaya, nun na xɛmɛ xili. E naxa wɔyɛn e bɛ a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, a e naxa masenyi yo ti, e naxa mixi yo xaran Isa xili ra sɔnɔn. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Piyɛri nun Yaya naxa e yaabi, «Wo a mato, a lanma muxu xa bira wo tan nan fɔxɔ ra ba, ka Ala? <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Muxu mu nɔma dundude fe ma muxu bara naxan to, muxu bara naxan mɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />E man naxa xaaɲɛ e ma, kɔnɔ ɲama birin to nu Ala matɔxɔma fe ma naxan bara raba, e mu nɔ lande a ma a lanma e xa e ɲaxankata ki naxɛ. E naxa e rabɛɲin. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Yi xɛmɛ naxan nayalanxi, a xa simaya nu bara dangi ɲɛ tongo naani ra.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Togondiyatɔɛe Ala maxandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />E to e bɛɲin, Piyɛri nun Yaya naxa siga e booree yire. E naxa fe birin yaba e bɛ sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun forie naxan fala e bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />E to na mɛ, e birin naxa e xui ite Ala ma ɲanige keren fari. E naxa a maxandi, «Marigi, i tan naxan koore daa, a nun bɔxi, a nun baa, a nun se naxan birin na duniɲa, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />i tan nan a fala Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra, i xa konyi Dawuda dɛ ra, muxu baba,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 4:25" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‹Munfe ra sie bɔɲɛ texi fufafu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Munfe ra ɲamae matandi tife?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Duniɲa mangɛe bara keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">xunmatie bara ti Marigi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">nun a xa Mixi Sugandixi kanke.›»<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />«Nɔndi na a ra, Herode, Ponsi Pilati, xɔɲɛe, a nun Isirayila bɔnsɔɛe bara ti i xa konyi sɛniyɛnxi Isa kanke, i naxan sugandixi, <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />alako e xa fe birin naba i singe nu bara natɛ tongo a nu lan naxan xa raba. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Yakɔsi, Marigi, i xa a mato e xaaɲɛxi ki naxɛ. Sɛnbɛ fi i xa konyie ma, alako e xa nɔ i xa wɔyɛnyi masende limaniya ra. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />I bɛlɛxɛ itala, alako mixi xa rayalan, kaabanakoee nun tɔnxumae xa raba i xa konyi sɛniyɛnxi Isa xili ra.»<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />E to gɛ Ala maxandide, e nu malanxi dɛnnaxɛ, na naxa sɛrɛn. Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro e birin ma. E naxa so Ala xa wɔyɛnyi masenfe limaniya ra.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Togondiyatɔɛe xa lanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama birin bɔɲɛ ma fe naxa lu keren. Mixi yo mu a falama a keren gbe nan na se nde ra, kɔnɔ se birin naxa findi birin gbe ra. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Xɛɛrae naxa Marigi Isa xa marakeli masen mixie bɛ sɛnbɛ ra. Ala naxa hinnɛ e ra a fanyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Setare yo mu nu na e ya ma, barima xɛe nun banxie nu na naxee birin yi ra, e nu e matima nɛ, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />e nu a sare dɛntɛgɛ xɛɛrae bɛ. Nee nu fa a itaxun kankan hayi bɛrɛ ma.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Mixi nde nu na naxan xili Yusufu, Lewi di naxan barixi Sipiri. Xɛɛrae nu a xili falama nɛ Baranabasi, na nan falaxi «mixi ralimaniya». <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />A naxa xɛ mati naxan nu na a yi, a naxa fa a kɔbiri ra, a a dɛntɛgɛ xɛɛrae bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiyasi nun Safira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Xɛmɛ nde naxan xili Ananiyasi, a nun a xa ginɛ Safira, nee fan naxa e xa xɛ mati. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Ananiyasi nun a xa ginɛ naxa lan a ma e xa xɛ sare nde ragata e yɛtɛ bɛ. Ananiyasi naxa kɔbiri dɔnxɔɛ xanin, a a dɛntɛgɛ xɛɛrae bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ananiyasi, munfe ra Sentanɛ i madaxuxi han i bara wule fala Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi bɛ yi xɛ sare nde nɔxunfe ra? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Beenun i xa yi xɛ mati, i gbe xa mu nu na xɛ ra? I kɔbiri naxan sɔtɔxi, i gbe xa mu nu na fan na? Munfe ra i yi fe mɔɔli rabaxi? I mu wule falaxi mixie xa bɛ, i wule falaxi Ala nan bɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananiyasi to na wɔyɛnyi mɛ, a naxa bira keren na, a faxa. Naxee birin na fe mɛ, e naxa gaaxu. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Sɛgɛtalae to keli, e naxa a kasange, e a xanin, e sa a ragata.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Waxati saxan to dangi, a xa ginɛ naxa so, a mu nu a kolon fe naxan nabaxi. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «A fala n bɛ, xa wo xɛ matixi yi xasabi nan na, wo naxan dɛntɛgɛxi yi ki?» A naxa a yaabi, «Iyo, muxu a matixi yi kɔbiri nan na.» <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Awa, Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «Munfe ra wo lanxi a ma wo xa Ala Xaxili madaxu? Naxee i xa mɔri ragataxi, e tan nan tixi naadɛ ra yi ki, e i fan xaninma ya.»<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />A naxa bira xɛɛra bun ma keren na, a faxa. Sɛgɛtalae to so, e naxa a li a fan bara faxa. E naxa a xanin, e sa a fan nagata a xa mɔri fɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Gaaxui xungbe naxa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama birin suxu, a nun naxee birin yi fe mɛ.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Kaabanako wuyaxi nun tɔnxumae nu rabama ɲama tagi xɛɛrae saabui ra. Togondiyatɔɛ birin nu e malanma Sulemani xa buntunyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Mixi gbɛtɛ yo mu nu suusama sunbude e ra, kɔnɔ mixie nu e binyama a fanyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Naxee nu danxaniyaxi Marigi ma, xɛmɛe nun ginɛe, e kɔnti xun nu masama tɛmui birin. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Na fee ma, mixie nu fama nɛ furemae ra sade nun dagie ma kira xɔn, alako Piyɛri nɛ dangima tɛmui naxɛ, a niini xa ti e ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Ɲama nu kelima Darisalamu rabilinyi, e nu fa furemae ra nun ɲinnɛ fure kanyie. E birin naxa yalan.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xɛɛrae makankanfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Na tɛmui sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi, a nun naxee nu na a fɔxɔ ra, naxee findixi Sadusenie ra, e naxa natɛ tongo tɔɔnɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />E naxa xɛɛrae suxu, e e woli geeli. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Kɔnɔ Marigi xa malekɛ naxa fa kɔɛ ra, a naxa geeli naadɛ rabi, a fa e ramini. A naxa a fala e bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />«Wo siga, wo sa ti hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, wo Ala xa kira nɛɛnɛ xa fe birin tagi raba ɲama bɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />E to na mɛ, e naxa so hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui subaxɛ ma, e kawandi ti fɔlɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi nun naxee nu na a fɔxɔ ra, e to fa, e naxa Yuwifi kiitisae nun Isirayila fori birin malan. E naxa mixie rasiga xɛɛrae tongode geeli kui. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Sɔrie to siga, e mu e li geeli kui. E naxa gbilen, e sa dɛntɛgɛ sa. <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />E naxɛ, «Muxu bara geeli li a balanxi a fanyi ra, geeli kantamae tixi naadɛ ra, kɔnɔ muxu to a rabi, muxu mu mixi yo lixi a kui.»<verse eid="ACT 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Hɔrɔmɔbanxi sɔɔrie xa mangɛ nun sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie to na fe mɛ, e dɛ naxa ixara. E nu fa e bore maxɔrin, «Munfe yi ra?» <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Mixi nde naxa fa a fala e bɛ, «Wo fa a mato, wo xɛmɛ naxee sa geeli, e na hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui e mixie xaranfe.» <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Awa, sɔɔri xunmati nun a xa sɔɔrie naxa siga, e sa fa xɛɛrae ra. Kɔnɔ e mu e sɛnbɛ ramini e ma, barima e nu gaaxuxi ɲama fa e magɔnɔfe gɛmɛ ra.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />E to bara e xanin Yuwifi kiitisae yire, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi naxa e maxɔrin, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />«Muxu bara wo ratɔn a xɔrɔxɔɛ ra, wo naxa xaranyi raba yi xɛmɛ xili ra, kɔnɔ wo bara wo xa xaranyi ralantan Darisalamu birin na. Wo wama a xa faxɛ safe muxu tan nan xun!» <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Piyɛri nun xɛɛrae naxa e yaabi, «A lanma muxu xa Ala xui nan nabatu dangife mixie xui ra. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Won babae Marigi Ala bara Isa rakeli, wo naxan faxa, wo naxan banban wuri ma. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Ala bara a rate a yirefanyi ma a xa findi Mangɛ nun Marakisima ra, alako Isirayila xa nɔ tuubide, e xa yunubi xa xafari. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Muxu nun Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi na yi fe seedee ra. Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi fima mixi nan ma, naxan na a xui rabatu.»<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />E to yi masenyi mɛ, e naxa xɔnɔ han e naxa wa xɛɛrae faxafe. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Kɔnɔ Farisɛni nde naxan xili Gamaliyɛli, sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔ kuntigi naxan nu rafan ɲama birin ma, na naxa keli Yuwifi kiitisae tagi. A naxa yaamari fi e xa xɛɛrae ramini sinden. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Awa, a naxa a fala kiitisae bɛ, «Isirayilakae, wo mɛɛni fe ma wo naxan nabama yi mixie ra. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Waxati dangixi xɛmɛ nde naxan xili Tudasi naxa a yɛtɛ igbo. Mixi kɛmɛ naani nan nu biraxi a fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ a to faxa e birin naxa yensen yɛ. A xa fe mu findi fefe ra.»<verse eid="ACT 5:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />«Na to dangi, Yudasi Galileka naxa mini xili sɛbɛ tɛmui. A naxa mixi wuyaxi bɛndun a ma, kɔnɔ a fan naxa faxa, a fɔxirabirɛe birin naxa yensen yɛ. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Yakɔsi n a falama wo bɛ, wo naxa fefe raba yi mixie ra. Wo gbilen e fɔxɔ ra. Xa yi fe birin fatanxi mixie nan na, a mu sɔɔnɛyama. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Kɔnɔ, xa a fatanxi Ala nan na, wo mu nɔma a xun nakanade. Wo wo ɲɛrɛ ki mato a fanyi ra, wo nun Ala naxa fa gere.»<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />E to lan fe keren ma, e naxa xɛɛrae xili, e e bɔnbɔ. E naxa e ratɔn wɔyɛnfe ra Isa xili ra, e fa e rabɛɲin.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Xɛɛrae to mini Yuwifi kiitisae tagi, e naxa ɲɛlɛxin barima Ala e tan nan sugandixi, e xa tɔɔrɔ Isa xili xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ, e nu kawandi tima hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, e man mixie xaranma e xɔnyi. E nu Isa, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa xibaaru fanyi masenma nɛ tɛmui birin.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Xɛɛra malima solofere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Na tɛmui, Isa fɔxirabirɛe kɔnti xun to nu masama, Yuwifie naxee Girɛki xui falama, e naxa e mawa Yuwifie xɔn naxee Eburu xui falama, barima lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ donse itaxunma tɛmui naxɛ, e nu nɛɛmuma nɛ kaaɲɛ ginɛe ma naxee Girɛki xui falama. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Xɛɛra fu nun firinyi naxa Isa fɔxirabirɛe malan, e naxa a fala e bɛ, «A mu lan muxu xa Ala xa masenyi kawandife rabolo donse itaxun fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Na nan a ra, n ngaxakerenyie, wo xɛmɛ solofere sugandi wo ya ma, mixi binyee, xaxilimaya nun Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi na naxee bɛ. Muxu xa yi donse itaxunfe so e yi ra, <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />alako muxu tan xa nu lu Ala maxandi ra nun Ala xui kawandi ra.»<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Na masenyi naxa rafan birin ma. E naxa Etiyɛn sugandi, xɛmɛ naxan xa danxaniya nu gbo, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi man nu goroxi naxan ma. E man naxa Filipu, Pirokoru, Nikanoro, Timon, nun Paramenasi sugandi, a nun Nikolasi Antiyɔkika naxan soxi Yuwifie xa diinɛ ya ma. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />E naxa e dɛntɛgɛ xɛɛrae bɛ. Xɛɛrae naxa e bɛlɛxɛ sa e xunyie ma, e naxa Ala maxandi e bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ala xa masenyi naxa yensen yɛ. Isa fɔxirabirɛe xun nu masama a gbegbe ra Darisalamu. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ wuyaxi fan nu danxaniyafe.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etiyɛn suxufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Ala naxa a xa hinnɛ nun sɛnbɛ fi Etiyɛn ma. A nu tɔnxumae nun kaabanako xungbee rabama ɲama tagi. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Sirenikae nun Alesandireka naxee nu salima salide kui, naxan xili «xɔrɛya mixi xa salide», a nun Yuwifie naxee kelixi Silisi nun Asi, e naxa sɔnxɔ Etiyɛn ma. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Kɔnɔ e mu nɔ Etiyɛn xa wɔyɛnyi ra, barima Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nan nu xaxilimaya fima a ma.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Awa, e naxa xɛmɛ ndee sare fi, e xa a fala, «Muxu bara a xui mɛ a wɔyɛnyi falama naxan mu daxa Annabi Munsa nun Ala mabiri.» <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />E naxa ɲama, forie, nun sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔe kui iso. E naxa bagan a ma, e a suxu, e a xanin Yuwifi kiitisae yire. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />E naxa tɔɔɲɛgɛlae ramini, naxee a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ mu bama wɔyɛnyi ɲaaxie falafe hɔrɔmɔbanxi nun Ala xa sɛriyɛ xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Muxu bara a xui mɛ, a a falama Isa Nasarɛtika fama yi hɔrɔmɔbanxi kanade, a man naamunyie masarama Annabi Munsa naxee fixi won ma.» <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Yuwifi kiitisae birin naxa e ya banban Etiyɛn na, a yatagi naxa lu e bɛ alɔ malekɛ.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Etiyɛn xa masenyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi naxa Etiyɛn maxɔrin, «Naxan falaxi i xun ma, nɔndi na a ra?» <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Etiyɛn naxa e yaabi, «N ngaxakerenyie nun n babae, wo wo tuli mati n na. Ala dariyɛ kanyi mini nɛ won baba Iburahima ma a nu na Mesopotamiya bɔxi ma tɛmui naxɛ, beenun a xa sabati Xarani. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Ala naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹Keli i xa bɔxi nun i xabilɛ xun, siga bɔxi ma n dɛnnaxɛ masenma i bɛ.› <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Awa, a naxa mini Kalidi bɔxi ra, a sa sabati Xarani. Mɛnni, a baba faxa xanbi, Ala naxa a radangi yi bɔxi ma wo sabatixi dɛnnaxɛ yi ki to. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />A mu lingira yo fi a ma yi bɔxi kui hali santide. Kɔnɔ a naxa laayidi tongo a bɛ, a fama yi bɔxi fide a tan nun a bɔnsɔɛ nan ma, hali a faxa xanbi. Na waxati di yo mu nu na a bɛ sinden.»<verse eid="ACT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />«Ala naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹I bɔnsɔɛ sabatima bɔxi gbɛtɛ nan ma. Mɛnni e findima nɛ konyie ra. E e ɲaxankata ɲɛ kɛmɛ naani bun.› <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ala man naxa a fala, ‹N fama na si makiitide naxan e rasoma konyiya kui. Na dangi xanbi, e kelima nɛ naa, e fa n batu be.›»<verse eid="ACT 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />«Awa, Ala naxa sunna saatɛ fi Iburahima ma. Iburahima to Isiyaga bari, a naxa a sunna a xi solomasaxan nde ma. Isiyaga to Yaxuba bari, a naxa a fan sunna. Yaxuba fan naxa won benba fu nun firinyie sunna.»<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />«Won benbae naxa Yusufu tɔɔnɛ, e naxa a mati, a naxa findi konyi ra Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Kɔnɔ Ala naxa lu a fɔxɔ ra. A naxa a ramini a xa kɔntɔfili birin kui. A naxa hinnɛ nun xaxilimaya fi a ma, alako a xa rafan Misira mangɛ ma, naxan a findi Misira gomina nun a xa banxi birin xunmati ra.»<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />«Kaamɛ xungbe naxa so Misira bɔxi ma a nun Kanaan bɔxi. Won babae mu nu baloe sɔtɔma, tɔɔrɛ naxa gbo. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Yaxuba naxa a mɛ a mɛngi na Misira bɔxi ma. A naxa won babae xɛɛ naa a singe. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />E xa sigɛ firin nde, Yusufu naxa a yɛtɛ masen a fafaxakerenyie bɛ, Misira mangɛ fan naxa Yusufu xabilɛ rakolon. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Awa, Yusufu naxa e xɛɛ a baba Yaxuba tongode nun a xa denbaya birin. E kɔnti nu sigaxi han mixi tongo solofere a nun suuli. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Yaxuba naxa goro Misira, a faxa dɛnnaxɛ a nun won babae. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />E furee naxa ragbilen Sikemi, e e ragata gaburi nan kui, Iburahima naxan sara kɔbiri ra Xamori xa die ma.»<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />«Ala xa laayidi rakamali waxati to makɔrɛ, laayidi naxan tongoxi Iburahima bɛ, won ma ɲama xun naxa masa Misira bɔxi ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kɔnɔ na xanbi mangɛ gbɛtɛ naxa ti naxan mu nu Yusufu xa fe kolon. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Na mangɛ naxa won ma ɲama yanfa. A naxa won benbae ɲaxankata, han a naxa e yaamari e xa e xa diyɔrɛe wɔlɛ, alako e xa faxa. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Na tɛmui Annabi Munsa naxa bari, Ala hinnɛ naxan na. Kike saxan a rabalofe a baba xa banxi kui. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Na xanbi a naxa a bɛlɛxɛ ba a ma. Misira mangɛ xa di ginɛ fa a tongo, a naxa a ramɔ alɔ a xa di. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Annabi Munsa naxa kolon sɔtɔ Misira xa fe birin ma. A wɔyɛn ki nun a ɲɛrɛ ki naxa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />«A to ɲɛ tongo naani sɔtɔ, a naxa wa a ngaxakerenyie kolonfe. A naxa siga a boore Isirayilakae yire matode. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />A to Misiraka to a fe ɲaaxi niyafe Isirayilaka nde ra, Annabi Munsa naxa a ngaxakerenyi xa gere so, a naxa Misiraka faxa. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />A naxa a maɲɔxun a a ngaxakerenyie a kolonma nɛ Ala xɔrɛya fima e ma a saabui nan na, kɔnɔ e mu kolon sɔtɔ na ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Na kuye iba, Annabi Munsa naxa Isirayilaka firin to, e na gerefe. A naxa kata e xa lan e bore ma, a naxa a fala e bɛ, ‹Ngaxakerenmae nan na wo ra. Munfe ra wo fe ɲaaxi niyama wo bore ra?› <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Kɔnɔ naxan nu fe ɲaaxi rabafe a ngaxakerenyi ra, a naxa Annabi Munsa radin yɛ, a a fala a bɛ, ‹Nde i tixi mangɛ nun kiitisa ra muxu xun ma? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />I waxi n faxafe nɛ alɔ i Misiraka faxaxi ki naxɛ xoro?› <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Annabi Munsa to na wɔyɛnyi mɛ, a naxa a gi. A naxa sabati Madiyan bɔxi ma, a naxa di firin bari mɛnni.»<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />«Ɲɛ tongo naani dangi xanbi, malekɛ naxa mini a ma tɛ xɔɔra naxan nu sansi bili ganfe gbengberenyi ma, Sinayi geya fari. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Annabi Munsa to na fe to, a naxa kaaba. A to a maso a ra, a xa a igbɛ, a naxa Marigi xui mɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‹I babae Marigi Ala nan n na, Iburahima, Isiyaga, nun Yaxuba Marigi Ala.› Annabi Munsa naxa sɛrɛn, a naxa gaaxu a igbɛfe ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Marigi naxa a fala a bɛ, ‹Sankiri ba i sanyi, barima i tixi dɛnnaxɛ, bɔxi sɛniyɛnxi na a ra. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />N bara n ma ɲama xa tɔɔrɛ to Misira, n bara e kutun xui mɛ. N bara goro n xa xɔrɛya fi e ma. Yakɔsi, n xa i xɛɛ Misira.› <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Ala Annabi Munsa xɛɛ nɛ, e a fala naxan bɛ, ‹Nde i tixi mangɛ nun kiitisa ra muxu xun ma.› Malekɛ naxan minixi a ma tɛ xɔɔra a naxa a masen a bɛ a xa findi mangɛ nun marakisima ra.»<verse eid="ACT 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />«Annabi Munsa nan Isirayilakae ramini Misira bɔxi ra. Ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma, a naxa tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoee raba Misira, Xulunyumi Baa, nun gbengberenyi ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Annabi Munsa tan naxa a fala Isirayila bɛ, ‹Ala namiɲɔnmɛ raminima wo ngaxakerenyie nan ya ma naxan luma alɔ n tan.› <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Won benbae ɲama e to nu malanxi gbengberenyi ma, malekɛ naxa wɔyɛn Annabi Munsa bɛ Sinayi geya fari. A sɛriyɛ naxan mɛxi, a naxa na radangi won ma.»<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />«Kɔnɔ won benbae mu tin a xa yaamari suxude. E naxa a matandi, e e bɔɲɛ ti Misira ra. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />E naxa a fala Haruna bɛ, ‹Alae yailan won bɛ, naxee ɲɛrɛma won ya ra, barima yi Munsa naxan won naminixi Misira, won mu a kolon se naxan a sɔtɔxi.› <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />E naxa kuye yailan ninge misaali ra, e fa sɛrɛxɛ ba a bɛ. E naxa ɲɛlɛxin na ra, e naxan yailanxi e bɛlɛxɛe ra.»<verse eid="ACT 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />«Awa, Ala naxa a kobe so e ra, a naxa e rabolo, e xa tunbuie batu, alɔ a sɛbɛxi namiɲɔnmɛ xa Kitaabui kui ki naxɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‹Isirayila bɔnsɔɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">wo sɛrɛxɛe ba n tan nan bɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">ɲɛ tongo naani bun ma gbengberenyi ma?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Wo bara Mɔlɔkɔ kuye batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">wo bara Remefan tunbui kuye batu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">wo kuye naxee yailanxi wo bɛlɛxɛ ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Na nan a toxi n fan wo xaninma Babilɔn xanbi ra.›»<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />«Ala xa hɔrɔmɔlingira, a xa seedeɲɔxɔya sɛbɛli na dɛnnaxɛ, na nu na won benbae tagi gbengberenyi ma. Ala nu bara a misaali masen Annabi Munsa bɛ, a naxa a yaamari a xa a yailan na ki. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Won benbae to hɔrɔmɔlingira sɔtɔ, e naxa a xanin bɔxi ma Ala si gbɛtɛe keri dɛnnaxɛ, Yosuwe xa yaamari bun ma. A naxa lu naa han Dawuda xa waxati.»<verse eid="ACT 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />«Dawuda naxan nafanxi Ala ma, na naxa a maxɔrin a xa lingira ti a tan Yaxuba Marigi Ala bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Kɔnɔ Sulemani nan fa na lingira ti Ala bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Kɔnɔ Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi mu sabatima adama xa banxi tixi kui. Namiɲɔnmɛ na nan masenxi,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‹Wo Marigi naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">koore, n ma kibanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">bɔxi, n santide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Wo banxi mundun tima n bɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Wo yire mundun findima n ma malabude ra?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />N tan xa mu na birin yailanxi?›»<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />«Wo xaxili nun wo tuli xɔrɔxɔ, wo sondonyi mu fan. Wo Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi matandima tɛmui birin alɔ wo benbae a raba ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Wo benbae namiɲɔnmɛe birin ɲaxankata nɛ. E namiɲɔnmɛe faxa nɛ, naxee nu Ala xa Tinxintɔɛ xa fafe falama. Yakɔsi wo bara na fan faxa. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Wo tan naxee bara Ala xa sɛriyɛ sɔtɔ malekɛe saabui ra, wo mu a rabatuxi!»<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etiyɛn xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />E to yi masenyi mɛ, e naxa xɔnɔ han e nu e ɲinyie raxin. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Kɔnɔ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro Etiyɛn ma. Etiyɛn to a ya banban koore ma, a naxa Ala xa dariyɛ to, a man naxa Isa to a tixi Ala yirefanyi ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />A naxa a masen, «N bara koore rabixi to, Adama xa Di tixi Ala yirefanyi ma.» <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ɲama naxa sɔnxɔɛ rate, e naxa e tuli dɛsɛ. E birin naxa bagan a ma. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />E naxa mini a bubu ra sigafe ra taa fari ma, e a magɔnɔ han a naxa faxa. Seedee naxa e xa donmae sa sɛgɛtala nde san ma, naxan xili Sɔlu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />E nu na a magɔnɔfe tɛmui naxɛ, Etiyɛn naxa Ala maxandi, «N Marigi Isa, n nii rasɛnɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Na xanbi a naxa a xinbi sin, a naxa a xui ite, «N Marigi, i naxa e suxu yi yunubi ma!» A gɛ na falade tan mu a ra, a naxa taa masara. Sɔlu fan nu na Etiyɛn faxafe kui.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="s">Danxaniyatɔɛe xa tɔɔrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Na lɔxɔɛ, ɲaxankatɛ xungbe naxa Darisalamu danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama suxu. E birin naxa yensen Samari nun Yudaya bɔxi ma fo xɛɛrae, nee nan gbansan lu naa. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Xɛmɛ tinxinxie naxa Etiyɛn nagata. E naxa wa a xa faxɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Kɔnɔ Sɔlu tan naxa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama tɔɔrɔ. A nu soma banxie kui, a nu danxaniyatɔɛ xɛmɛe nun ginɛe ramini, a nu fa e sa geeli. <verse eid="ACT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Danxaniyatɔɛ to yensen yɛ, e naxa xibaaru fanyi kawandi ti yire birin.<verse eid="ACT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Xibaaru fanyi kawandife Samari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipu to goro Samari taa nde kui, a naxa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa fe masen naakae bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Ɲama to Filipu xa kaabanakoee to, e naxa e tuli mati a ra a fanyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Ɲinnɛe naxa gbilen furemae fɔxɔ ra, e nu fa gbelegbele. Mabɛnyi nun namatɛ wuyaxi naxa yalan. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Naakae naxa sɛɛwa a fanyi ra.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Xɛmɛ nde nu na na taa kui naxan xili Simɔn. A nu duureya rabama naxan Samarikae birin nakaabama, a nu fa a yɛtɛ igbo. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />E birin, dimɛdie nun forie, a xui ramɛxi a fanyi ra. E nu a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ Ala sɛnbɛ na a ra, won naxan xili falama Sɛnbɛ Xungbe.» <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />E nu bara bira a fɔxɔ ra kabi a xɔnnakuye barima a nu e rakaabama a xa duureya ra. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Kɔnɔ e to la Filipu ra, naxan Ala xa mangɛya niini nun Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa xibaaru fanyi kawandi rabama, xɛmɛe nun ginɛe naxa e xunxa ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Simɔn yati naxa danxaniya, a fan naxa a xunxa ye xɔɔra. A naxa bira Filipu fɔxɔ ra. A naxa kaaba a xa tɔnxumae nun kaabanako xungbee ma.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Xɛɛrae, naxee nu na Darisalamu, e to a mɛ Samarikae bara tin Ala xa masenyi ra, e naxa Piyɛri nun Yaya xɛɛ naa. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />E to so naa, e naxa Ala maxandi alako Samarikae xa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />barima Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi mu nu goroxi mixi yo ma e ya ma sinden. E nu xunxaxi ye nan gbansan xɔɔra Isa xili xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Awa, Piyɛri nun Yaya naxa e bɛlɛxɛ sa e ma, e naxa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Simɔn to a to Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nu sɔtɔma xɛɛrae bɛlɛxɛe nan saabui ra, a naxa kɔbiri masen e bɛ, a fa a fala, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />«Wo yi sɛnbɛ fi n fan ma, alako n na n bɛlɛxɛe sa naxan ma, a xa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Piyɛri naxa a yaabi, «I tan nun i xa kɔbiri xun xa rakana, barima i a maɲɔxunxi nɛ Ala xa ki sɔtɔma kɔbiri nan na. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />I gbe yo mu na yi fe ya ma, barima i sondonyi mu fiixɛxi Ala bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Gbilen yi fe ɲaaxi fɔxɔ ra. I man xa Marigi maxandi alako a xa diɲɛ i ma i xa yi maɲɔxunyi xa fe ra, xa a sa tinma. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />N a toxi nɛ yi ki, i na fe ɲaaxi gbegbe kui. I bara findi Sentanɛ xa konyi ra.»<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Simɔn naxa a yaabi, «Wo yɛtɛ xa Marigi maxandi n bɛ alako wo fe naxee birin falaxi a naxa n li.» <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />E to gɛ seedeɲɔxɔya bade Marigi xa masenyi ra, Piyɛri nun Yaya naxa gbilen Darisalamu. Kira fan na, e naxa xibaaru fanyi kawandi ti Samari taa wuyaxi kui.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etiyopi xunmati nde xunxafe ye xɔɔra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Marigi xa malekɛ naxa a fala Filipu bɛ, «Keli, siga yirefanyi biri ra, gbengberen kira xɔn, naxan goroma Gasa, kelife Darisalamu.» <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />A naxa keli, a naxa Etiyopika nde li kira ra. Xɛmɛ nan nu a ra naxan mu nu nɔma ginɛ fe rabade. A findixi Kandasi, Etiyopi mangɛ ginɛ xunmati nan na. A tan nan nu a xa naafuli birin kantama. A nu faxi salide nɛ Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />A na gbilenfe a xɔnyi, a dɔxɔxi a xa maɲɛrɛse kui, a na Annabi Esayi xa Kitaabui xaranfe.<verse eid="ACT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa a masen Filipu bɛ, «Siga, i i makɔrɛ na maɲɛrɛse ra.» <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipu naxa siga a gi ra. A naxa Etiyopika xui mɛ, a nu Annabi Esayi xa Kitaabui xaranfe. A naxa a maxɔrin, «I naxan xaranfe yi ki, i a fahaamuxi?» <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />A naxa a yaabi, «N nɔma na ra di, xa mixi yo mu na naxan a tagi rabama n bɛ?» A naxa a fala Filipu bɛ a xa dɔxɔ a sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />A nu na yi sɛbɛli nan xaranfe Kitaabui kui:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">«E a xaninxi tɛmui naxɛ a xa faxa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">a naxa lu alɔ yɛxɛɛ naxan xaninma faxade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">A mu a xui yo ramini,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">alɔ yɛxɛɛ naxan tima a xabe maxabama ya ra.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />A xa marayaagi kui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">e naxa a makiiti sɛriyɛ xanbi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Nde nɔma a xa taruxui falade?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">A xa simaya bara ɲɔn bɔxi fari.»<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Na Etiyopika naxa a fala Filipu bɛ, «Yandi, a masen n bɛ, Annabi Esayi nde xa fe falama yi ki? A yɛtɛ ba, ka mixi gbɛtɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Awa, Filipu naxa a fɔlɔ na sɛbɛli ma, a naxa a kawandi Isa xa xibaaru fanyi ra.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />E na sigafe kira xɔn, e naxa ye li. Na Etiyopika naxa a fala Filipu bɛ, «Ye nan ya. Nanse a niyama n mu xunxama ye xɔɔra?» <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipu naxa a yaabi, «Xa i danxaniya i bɔɲɛ birin na, i nɔma na ra.» Na Etiyopika naxa a yaabi, «N laxi a ra, Ala xa Di nan lanxi Isa ma.» <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />A naxa maɲɛrɛse rati, e firin birin naxa goro ye ma. Filipu naxa na Etiyopika xunxa ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />E to te ye xɔɔra, Marigi Xaxili naxa Filipu tongo, a a xanin. Na Etiyopika mu fa a to sɔnɔn. A naxa siga sɛɛwɛ kui.<verse eid="ACT 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipu naxa mini Asotu taa kui. A man naxa siga Sesare. A naxa xibaaru fanyi kawandi ti taa birin kui a nu dangima dɛnnaxɛ.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sɔlu xunxafe ye xɔɔra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Na tɛmui birin, Sɔlu nu kɔnkɔxi Marigi fɔxirabirɛe ma, a xa e faxa. A naxa siga sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi xɔn <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />kɛɛdi maxɔrinde katarabi Damasi salide yareratie ma, alako xa a naxee li naa, e biraxi Isa xa kira fɔxɔ ra, xɛmɛe nun ginɛe, a xa fa e xirixi ra Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />A na makɔrɛfe Damasi ra, yanbɛ naxa mini a ma keli koore ma, a a rabilin. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />A naxa bira bɔxi ma, a naxa xui nde mɛ, «Sɔlu, Sɔlu, i na n ɲaxankatafe munfe ra?» <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sɔlu naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, nde i ra?» A naxa a yaabi, «Isa nan n na, i naxan ɲaxankatafe. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Keli, so taa kui, e fama a falade i bɛ a lanma i xa naxan naba.» <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Xɛmɛe naxee nu a fɔxɔ ra, nee dɛ naxa bobo a ra gaaxui bɛ. E nu xui mɛma, kɔnɔ e mu nu mixi yo toma. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sɔlu naxa keli bɔxi ma, a ya rabixi, kɔnɔ a ya mu se toma. E naxa a bɛlɛxɛ suxu, e a mati Damasi.<verse eid="ACT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />A naxa lu xi saxan a mu sese to, a mu sese don, a mu sese min. <verse eid="ACT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ nde nu na Damasi, naxan xili Ananiyasi. Marigi naxa a xili laamatunyi kui, «Ananiyasi!» Ananiyasi naxa a ratin, «Marigi, n tan nan ya.» <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Marigi naxa a fala a bɛ, «Keli, siga kira ra naxan xili ‹Kira Tinxinxi›, i xa xɛmɛ fen Yudasi xa banxi kui, naxan xili Sɔlu Tariseka. A na Ala maxandife. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />A bara mixi nde to laamatunyi kui, naxan xili Ananiyasi, a na a bɛlɛxɛ safe a ma alako a man xa se to.» <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiyasi naxa a yaabi, «Marigi, n bara yi xɛmɛ xa fe mɛ mixi wuyaxi ra, a bara fe kobi naxan naba i xa mixi sɛniyɛnxie ra Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie bara nɔɛ so a yi ra, a xa birin suxu naxee i xili maxandima.»<verse eid="ACT 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Kɔnɔ Marigi naxa Ananiyasi yaabi, «Siga, barima n bara yi xɛmɛ sugandi xɛɛra ra, a xa n xili masen si birin bɛ, e xa mangɛe bɛ, a nun Isirayila die birin bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />N a masenma nɛ a bɛ, a fama tɔɔrɔde ki naxɛ n xili xa fe ra.» <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ananiyasi naxa siga na banxi. A to so, a naxa a bɛlɛxɛ sa Sɔlu ma. A naxa a fala a bɛ, «N ngaxakerenyi Sɔlu, Marigi Isa naxan mini i ma kira ra, a tan nan n xɛɛxi i ma, alako i xa se to, i man xa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Se nde naxa ba a ya ma keren na alɔ xalee, a ya naxa se to. A naxa keli, a fa a xunxa ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Na xanbi a naxa a dɛge, a fa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sɔlu kawandi rabafe Damasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sɔlu naxa saxanyi raba Damasi a nun Isa fɔxirabirɛe. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />A naxa bɔnbɔ kawandi tife ra keren na salidee kui a nu a masen a Ala xa Di nan lanxi Isa ma. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Naxee birin a xui mɛ, e dɛ naxa ixara. E naxa a fala, «Yi xɛmɛ xa mu nu mixie ɲaxankatama Darisalamu, naxee nu maxandi tima Isa xili ra? A mu faxi xɛ be, a xa e xanin e xirixi ra sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie xɔn?» <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Sɔlu naxa sɛnbɛ sɔtɔ. A xa masenyi naxa Damasi Yuwifie ifu, a falafe a Isa nan lanxi Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ma.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Tɛmui nde to dangi, Yuwifie naxa lan a ma e xa Sɔlu faxa. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Sɔlu naxa e xa gundo kolon. E nu taa sode dɛ kantama kɔɛ nun yanyi alako e xa a faxa. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Kɔnɔ kɔɛ nde ra, Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa a ragoro tɛtɛ fari ma saga kui.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔlu sigafe Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sɔlu to siga Darisalamu, a naxa wa bonife Isa fɔxirabirɛe ra, kɔnɔ e birin nu gaaxuxi a ya ra. E mu nu laxi a ra xa Isa fɔxirabirɛ nan yati a ra. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Awa, Baranabasi naxa a xanin xɛɛrae xɔn. A naxa a tagi raba e bɛ Sɔlu Marigi toxi ki naxɛ, a man a xui mɛxi kira ra ki naxɛ. A naxa a masen e bɛ Sɔlu bara kawandi naxan naba Isa xili ra Damasi taa kui. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />E birin naxa dɔxɔ yire keren Darisalamu. Sɔlu nu Marigi xili kawandima sɛnbɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />E nun Yuwifie fan naxa wɔyɛn e nu xɔrɔxɔ, Yuwifi naxee Girɛki xui falama, kɔnɔ nee nu katafe e xa Sɔlu faxa. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />A ngaxakerenyi Isayankae to na fe mɛ, e naxa a xanin Sesare, e fa a rasiga Tarise. <verse eid="ACT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama naxa lu bɔɲɛsa kui Yudaya, Galile, nun Samari bɔxi birin ma. E nu luma e bore ralimaniya ra, e nu e ɲɛrɛ Marigi xa yaragaaxui kui. E xun nu masama Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri sigafe Lida nun Yafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Piyɛri to nu bɔxi iɲɛrɛma, a naxa goro sɛniyɛntɔɛe yire Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />A naxa xɛmɛ namataxi nde li naa, naxan xili Ene, a nu saxi sade ma kabi ɲɛ solomasaxan. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Piyɛri naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ene, Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi bara i rayalan. Keli, i i xa sade yailan.» A naxa keli keren na. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Lidakae nun Sarɔnka birin to yi fe to, e naxa tuubi Marigi ma.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Ginɛ nde nu na Yafa Isa fɔxirabirɛe ya ma. A nu xili Tabita, naxan falaxi Dɔrakasi. A nu fe fanyi gbegbe rabama, a nu tɔɔrɔmixie ki. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Na tɛmui, fure naxa a suxu, a naxa faxa. E to a maxa, e naxa a sa koore banxi dɛki firin nde. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxee nu na Yafa, e naxa a mɛ a Piyɛri na Lida. Lida mu makuya Yafa ra. Awa, e naxa xɛmɛ firin xɛɛ Piyɛri ma, e xa a mayandi a xa fa e xɔnyi mafuren. <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Piyɛri naxa keli, e nun na xɛmɛe naxa siga. E to so, e naxa a xanin koore banxi kɔn na. Kaaɲɛ ginɛe naxa a rabilin, e wama. E naxa dugie nun sosee masen a bɛ Dɔrakasi naxee yailan a nu na e ya ma tɛmui naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Piyɛri naxa e birin namini tande. A naxa a xinbi sin, a Ala maxandi. Na xanbi, a naxa a mafindi fure mabiri ra. A naxa a fala, «Tabita, keli.» Tabita naxa a ya rabi. A to Piyɛri to, a naxa keli. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Piyɛri naxa a bɛlɛxɛ suxu, a a rakeli. A naxa sɛniyɛntɔɛe nun kaaɲɛ ginɛe xili. A naxa a ɲiɲɛ dɛntɛgɛ e bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Yafakae birin naxa na fe mɛ. Mixi wuyaxi naxa danxaniya Marigi ma. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Piyɛri naxa xi wuyaxi raba Yafa, Simɔn garange xɔnyi.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Koroneliyo xunxafe ye xɔɔra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Xɛmɛ nde nu na Sesare naxan nu xili Koroneliyo. Sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunmati nan nu a ra Itali sɔɔri gali ya ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Diinɛla nan nu a ra. A tan nun a xa mixi birin nu gaaxuxi Ala ya ra. A nu setaree malima a gbegbe ra, a man nu Ala maxandima tɛmui birin.<verse eid="ACT 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Nunmare ra, a naxa Ala xa malekɛ nde to laamatunyi ra, a sofe a xɔnyi. Malekɛ naxa a xili, «Koroneliyo.» <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Koroneliyo to a to, a naxa gaaxu. A naxa a fala, «Marigi, munse niyaxi?» Malekɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ala bara i xa maxandi suxu. A bara ratu i ma, i bara naxan naba setaree bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Yakɔsi, i xa mixi ndee xɛɛ Yafa e xa fa Simɔn na, naxan xili falama Piyɛri. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />A yigiyaxi Simɔn garange xɔnyi baa dɛ ra.»<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Malekɛ to gɛ wɔyɛnde, a naxa siga. Koroneliyo naxa konyi firin xili, a nun a xa sɔɔri diinɛla, naxan nu walima a bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />A naxa yi fe birin yaba e bɛ, a fa e xɛɛ Yafa. <verse eid="ACT 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Na kuye iba yanyi tagi ɲɔndɔn, e nu na kira xɔn ma tɛmui naxɛ, e makɔrɛ taa ra, Piyɛri naxa te koore banxi fari a xa Ala maxandi. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Na tɛmui kaamɛ naxa a suxu, a nu wama a dɛgefe. Beenun donse xa gɛ yailande, a naxa laamatunyi to.<verse eid="ACT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />A naxa koore to a rabixi, se nde naxa goro bɔxi alɔ dugi, a xirixi a tunxun naanie ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Subee, bubusee, nun xɔni birin nu na na dugi kui. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Xui nde naxa a fala, «Piyɛri, keli, i sube nde faxa, i xa a don.» <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Kɔnɔ Piyɛri naxa a yaabi, «Ade, Marigi. N mu nu se raharamuxi don sinden, xa na mu a ra se sɛniyɛntare.» <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Xui naxa wɔyɛn a bɛ a firin nde, «Ala bara se naxan nasɛniyɛn i naxa a fala a sɛniyɛntare.» <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Na naxa raba sanya saxan. Na xanbi, na dugi man naxa te koore ma.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Piyɛri to nu a maɲɔxunfe na laamatunyi ma, a wama naxan masenfe, Koroneliyo xa xɛɛrae nu bara Simɔn xɔnyi maxɔrin. E naxa ti naadɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />E naxa maxɔrinyi ti xa Simɔn yigiyaxi naa nɛ, e naxan xili falama Piyɛri. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Piyɛri nu a maɲɔxunfe laamatunyi ma tɛmui naxɛ, Ala Xaxili naxa a masen a bɛ, «Xɛmɛ saxan na i maxɔrinfe. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Keli, i xa goro, wo birin xa siga. I naxa siikɛ, barima n tan nan e xɛɛxi.» <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Awa, Piyɛri naxa goro, a naxa a fala na xɛmɛe bɛ, «N tan nan yi ki wo naxan fenfe. Wo faxi munfe ma?» <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />E naxa dɛntɛgɛ sa, «Koroneliyo, sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati, nan muxu xɛɛxi. Xɛmɛ tinxinxi na a ra, naxan gaaxuxi Ala ya ra. Yuwifie birin a xili fanyi falama. Ala xa malekɛ sɛniyɛnxi bara a masen a bɛ a xa i rafa a xɔnyi alako a xa i xa masenyi ramɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Awa, Piyɛri naxa e yigiya. Na kuye iba, a naxa keli, e birin naxa siga. Yafaka danxaniyatɔɛ ndee fan naxa e mati.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Na kuye iba, e naxa so Sesare, Koroneliyo nu e mamɛfe dɛnnaxɛ. A nu bara a xa mixie nun a boore fanyie malan. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Piyɛri to so, Koroneliyo naxa a ralan, a naxa a yɛtɛ magoro a bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Kɔnɔ Piyɛri naxa a rakeli, a naxa a fala, «Keli, mixi nan na n fan na.» <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />E naxa so banxi e wɔyɛnma e bore ra. Piyɛri naxa mixi gbegbe malanxi li naa. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />A naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo a kolon tɔnyi dɔxɔxi Yuwifie ma e nun si gbɛtɛ bɔnsɔɛ naxa lu yire keren, xa na mu a ra sofe ra e xɔnyi. Kɔnɔ Ala bara a masen n bɛ a n naxa mixi yo maɲɔxun sɛniyɛntare ra. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Na na a ra, wo to n xili, n mu tondi fade. Awa, wo n xilixi munfe ma?» <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Koroneliyo naxa a masen a bɛ, «Na xi naani nan yi ki, n nu salife n ma banxi kui nunmare tɛmui. Xɛmɛ nde naxa mini n ma, a xa sosee yanbama. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />A naxa a masen n bɛ, ‹Koroneliyo, Ala bara i xa maxandi suxu. A bara ratu a ma i bara naxan naba setaree bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Awa, mixie xɛɛ Yafa, e xa fa Simɔn Piyɛri ra be. A yigiyaxi Simɔn garange xa banxi kui, baa dɛ ra.› <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />N naxa mixie xɛɛ keren na. Muxu bara ɲɛlɛxin ki fanyi i fafe ra. Awa, yakɔsi muxu birin na Ala ya i. I xa masenyi ti muxu bɛ, Marigi bara i yamari naxan birin na.»<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Awa, wɔyɛnyi to so Piyɛri yi, a naxa a masen, «Yakɔsi n bara a kolon nɔndi nan yati a ra, Ala mu mixi yo rafisaxi a boore bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />A wama mixi birin xɔn, sie birin ya ma, naxee gaaxuma a ya ra, naxee tinxin. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Ala bara xibaaru fanyi masen Isirayila ɲama bɛ. A bara a masen e bɛ a bɔɲɛsa sɔtɔma duniɲa Marigi Isa, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi nan na. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Wo a kolon naxan nabaxi fɔlɔfe Galile bɔxi ma, dɔxɔfe Yudaya birin na. Yaya nu bara kawandi ti mixie xa e xunxa ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Na tɛmui Ala naxa Isa Nasarɛtika sugandi, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nun sɛnbɛ naxa goro a ma. Isa naxa siga yire birin, a nu fe fanyi raba, a nu mixi birin nayalan naxee nu na Ibulisa xa konyiya bun. Ala nu na a fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />«Yi fe birin seede nan muxu ra a naxan naba Yuwifie xa bɔxi ma nun Darisalamu. E naxa a banban wuri ma, a faxa. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Kɔnɔ Ala naxa a rakeli faxɛ ma xi saxan lɔxɔɛ, duniɲa xa a to. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />A mu tin a makɛnɛnde birin bɛ, kɔnɔ a naxa a yɛtɛ masen muxu bɛ, Ala naxee sugandixi e xa findi seedee ra. Muxu nun Isa bara donse don, muxu bara ye min a keli xanbi faxɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Isa naxa muxu yamari, muxu xa kawandi ti mixie bɛ, e xa a kolon Ala nan Isa tixi kiitisa ra mixi baloxie nun mixi faxaxie xun ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Namiɲɔnmɛ birin nu bara a xa fe fala, naxan na danxaniya a ma na kanyi xa yunubi xafarima nɛ a xili saabui ra.»<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Piyɛri to nu wɔyɛnma, naxee birin nu yi masenyi ramɛfe, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro e ma. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Danxaniyatɔɛ sunnaxie naxee Piyɛri mati naa, e naxa kaaba yi fe ma, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi gorofe sunnataree fan ma, <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />barima e naxa e xui mɛ e na Ala matɔxɔfe xui gbɛtɛe ra. <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />Awa, Piyɛri naxa maxɔrinyi ti, «Mixi nde nɔma tondide yi mixie xa xunxa ye xɔɔra? E fan bara Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ alɔ won fan a sɔtɔxi ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />A naxa yaamari fi fa e xa e xunxa ye xɔɔra Isa xili ra. Na xanbi e naxa Piyɛri mayandi a xa lu e xɔnyi na saxanyi.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Piyɛri xunmafalafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Xɛɛrae nun ngaxakerenyie naxee nu na Yudaya, e naxa a mɛ a si gbɛtɛe fan bara tin Ala xa masenyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Piyɛri to te Darisalamu, Yuwifi danxaniyatɔɛe naxa a kalamu, «I bara so sunnataree xɔnyi, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />wo birin bara wo dɛge!»<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Awa Piyɛri naxa fe birin tagi raba e bɛ a dangixi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />A naxa a masen, «N nu na Yafa taa nan kui. N na Ala maxandife tɛmui naxɛ, n naxa laamatunyi to. Se nde naxan maniyaxi dugi xungbe ra, a xirixi a tunxun naanie ma, na naxa goro keli koore ma han n yire. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />N naxa a igbɛ a fanyi ra. N naxa xurusee, wula subee, bubusee, nun xɔni birin to a kui. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Xui nde naxa a fala, ‹Piyɛri, keli, i sube nde faxa, i xa a don.› <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Kɔnɔ n naxa a fala, ‹Ade, Marigi. N mu nu se raharamuxi don sinden, xa na mu a ra se sɛniyɛntare.› <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Xui naxa wɔyɛn n bɛ a firin nde, ‹Ala bara naxan nasɛniyɛn i naxa a fala a sɛniyɛntare.› <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Na naxa raba sanya saxan. Na xanbi, a birin man naxa te koore ma.»<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />«Na tɛmui mixi saxan, naxee nu xɛɛxi n yire kelife Sesare, e naxa ti muxu xa banxi naadɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ala Xaxili naxa a masen n bɛ a muxu birin xa siga, a hali n mu siikɛ. Yi xɛmɛ senni naxee yi ki, e fan naxa n mati naa. Muxu to so Koroneliyo xɔnyi, <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />a naxa a yaba muxu bɛ a malekɛ toxi a xa banxi kui ki naxɛ. Malekɛ naxa a masen a bɛ, ‹Mixi xɛɛ Yafa, a xa fa Simɔn na, e naxan xili falama Piyɛri. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />A fama masenyi tide i bɛ, i tan nun i xa mixi birin kisima naxan saabui ra.›»<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />«N to so wɔyɛnfe, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro e ma alɔ a goro won ma ki naxɛ a fɔlɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />N fa ratu Marigi xa masenyi ma, ‹Yaya bara mixi xunxa ye xɔɔra, kɔnɔ Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi fama gorode wo ma.› <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ala to bara e ki alɔ a won kixi ki naxɛ, won tan naxee danxaniyaxi Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ma, a nu lan n xa Ala matandi?»<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />E to na mɛ, e naxa dundu, e naxa Ala matɔxɔ, «Ala bara tuubi ragiri si gbɛtɛe fan bɛ, alako e fan xa kisi.»<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baranabasi nun Sɔlu sigafe Antiyɔki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Isa fɔxirabirɛ naxee yensen Etiyɛn faxa xanbi ɲaxankatɛ saabui ra, e naxa siga han Fenisiya, Sipiri, nun Antiyɔki. E nu Ala xa masenyi kawandima Yuwifie nan bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Kɔnɔ Sipirikae nun Sirenikae naxee nu na e ya ma, e to siga Antiyɔki, e naxa Marigi Isa xa xibaaru fanyi masen Girɛkikae fan bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Marigi xɔnyɛ nu na e ma. Mixi gbegbe naxa danxaniya, e naxa tuubi Marigi ma.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Darisalamu danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama to na fe mɛ, e naxa Baranabasi xɛɛ Antiyɔki. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />A to so naa, a naxa ɲɛlɛxin Ala xa hinnɛ tofe ra. A naxa e ralimaniya, e xa danxaniya Marigi ma. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Baranabasi, mixi fanyi nan nu a ra. A nu rafexi danxaniya nun Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi ra. Ɲama gbegbe naxa danxaniya Marigi ma.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Na xanbi, Baranabasi naxa siga Tarise Sɔlu fende. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />A to a to, a naxa fa a ra Antiyɔki. E nun danxaniyatɔɛe nan nu e malanma naa ɲɛ keren birin bun ma. E naxa mixi gbegbe xaran. Isa fɔxirabirɛ naxee nu na Antiyɔki, nee nan singe «Isayanka» xili sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Na tɛmui, namiɲɔnmɛ ndee naxa goro Antiyɔki, kelife Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Naxan nu xili Agabu, na naxa ti, a fa a fala Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi saabui ra, a kaamɛ xungbe fama sinde duniɲa birin ma. Na fe raba mangɛ Kilɔdi xa waxati nɛ. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa lan a ma e xa Yudaya ngaxakerenyie mali harige ra, kankan nɔma naxan na. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />E naxa a so Baranabasi nun Sɔlu yi ra katarabi kuntigie ma.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Tɔɔrɛ man xɛɛrae life</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Na tɛmui mangɛ Herode naxa so danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama mixi ndee tɔɔrɔfe. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />A naxa Yaki, Yaya taara, faxa santidɛgɛma ra. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />A to a to na nu rafan Yuwifie ma, a man naxa Piyɛri suxu Taami Lɛbinitare Sali. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />A to a suxu, a naxa a sa geeli kui. A naxa sɔɔri naani naani tongo xundɛ naani kui, a nee yamari, e xa a kanta. Herode nu waxi Piyɛri xa makiiti ɲama ya xɔri Sayamalekɛ Dangi Sali na ba a ra. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Piyɛri nu na geeli kui, kɔnɔ danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama nu na Ala maxandife a bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Kɔɛ ra, beenun Herode xa Piyɛri makiiti, a nu xife sɔɔri firin tagi, yɔlɔnxɔnyi balanxi a ma. Sɔɔri gbɛtɛe fan nu geeli naadɛ kantafe. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Marigi xa malekɛ nde naxa mini a ma tɛrɛnna ra. Yanbɛ naxa geeli kui iyalan. Malekɛ naxa Piyɛri sɛɛti mabɔnbɔ, a xa xunu, a fa a fala a bɛ, «Keli, i xulun!» Yɔlɔnxɔnyie naxa yolon a bɛlɛxɛ ra keren na. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Malekɛ naxa a fala a bɛ, «I maxiri, i xa sankirie so.» A to na raba, malekɛ man naxa a fala a bɛ, «Donma felen i ma, bira n fɔxɔ ra.» <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Piyɛri naxa mini, a bira malekɛ fɔxɔ ra, kɔnɔ a mu a kolon xa na fe findixi nɔndi nan na. A nu bara a maɲɔxun, tɛmunde a findixi laamatunyi nan na. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />E to bara dangi sɔɔrie singe e nun a firin ndee ra, e naxa wure naadɛ li naxan dɛ rabixi taa ma, na naxa rabi a yɛtɛ ra. E naxa mini. E mu nu a ikuyaxi kira xɔn ma, malekɛ naxa keli Piyɛri xun.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Piyɛri to xaxili sɔtɔ na fe ma, a naxa a fala, «Yakɔsi, n bara a kolon Marigi nan a xa malekɛ xɛɛxi, a xa n ba Herode yi ra. A bara n natanga Yuwifie bɛlɛxɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />A to kolon sɔtɔ yi fe ma, a naxa siga Yaya nga Mariyama xɔnyi, Yaya naxan man xili Maraki. Mixi wuyaxi nu malanxi naa, e na Ala maxandife. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />A to naadɛ kɔnkɔn, konyi ginɛ nde, naxan xili Roda, a naxa fa naadɛ rabide. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />A to Piyɛri xui mɛ, a naxa ɲɛlɛxin han a naxa nɛɛmu naadɛ rabife ma. A naxa a gi a xa sa a fala booree bɛ Piyɛri na naadɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />E naxa a fala a bɛ, «I bara daxu.» Kɔnɔ a to e karaxan, e naxa a fala, «A xa malekɛ na a ra.» <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Na tɛmui birin Piyɛri nu na naadɛ kɔnkɔnfe. E to naadɛ rabi, e naxa kaaba a tofe ma. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Piyɛri to e masabari a bɛlɛxɛ ra, a naxa a yaba e bɛ Marigi a raminixi geeli kui ki naxɛ. A naxa a fala, «Wo yi fe ragbilen Yaki nun ngaxakerenyie ma.» Na xanbi, a naxa mini, a xa siga yire gbɛtɛ.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Kuye to iba, sɔɔrie naxa lu maimaxɛ xungbe kui, a kolonfe ra Piyɛri xa fe niyaxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Herode naxa a fen, kɔnɔ a mu a to. A naxa sɔɔrie makiiti, a naxa yaamari fi a e birin xa faxa. Na xanbi, a naxa keli Yudaya, a naxa goro Sesare, a xa saxanyi radangi mɛnni.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Herode xa faxɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Tirekae nun Sidɔnkae nu na lantareya kui e nun Herode ra na tɛmui. E naxa lan e bore ma, e xa siga Herode yire, e xa wɔyɛn. E to bara Bilasitu masɔtɔ, mangɛ xa batula kuntigi, e naxa Herode mayandi lanyi xirife ra e tagi, barima e xa bɔxi xaxili nu tixi Herode xa bɔxi baloe nan na. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Malan lɔxɔɛ, Herode nu maxirixi a xa mangɛ sosee kui, a naxa masenyi ti ɲama bɛ, a dɔxɔxi mangɛ kibanyi kui. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Mixie naxa sɔnxɔɛ rate, «Ala xui nan yi ki, adama xui mu a ra.» <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Marigi xa malekɛ nde naxa a rafura keren na, barima a mu Ala matɔxɔ. Kulie naxa a don, a naxa faxa.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Na waxati mixi gbegbe naxa Ala xa wɔyɛnyi ramɛ, danxaniyatɔɛe kɔnti xun naxa masa. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Baranabasi nun Sɔlu to gɛ xɛɛra ibade Darisalamu, e naxa gbilen Yaya xanin na e xun ma, e naxan xili falama Maraki.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Baranabasi nun Sɔlu sugandife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Namiɲɔnmɛe nun karamɔxɔe nu na Antiyɔki danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama tagi: Baranabasi, Simeyɔn naxan xili sa Nigeri, Lususi Sirenika, Manahɛn, nun Sɔlu. Manahɛn nun mangɛ Herode nan xuru yire keren. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />E to nu Marigi batufe, e man nu sunfe, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo Baranabasi nun Sɔlu ti n bɛ e xati ma, wali xa fe ma n e xilixi naxan ma.» <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Awa, e to gɛ sunde, nun Ala maxandide, e naxa e bɛlɛxɛ sa Baranabasi nun Sɔlu ma, e xa e taxu Ala ra. Na xanbi, e naxa e bɛɲin, e siga.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">E sigafe Sipiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi to Baranabasi nun Sɔlu xɛɛ, e naxa goro Selusiya, e fa baki kunkui kui sigafe ra Sipiri suri ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />E to so Salamin, e naxa so Ala xa masenyi kawandife Yuwifie xa salide kui. Yaya nan nu e malima ra. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />E to bara suri igiri han Pafosi, e naxa duure nde li naa, Yuwifi naxan nu a yɛtɛ findixi namiɲɔnmɛ wule falɛ ra, naxan nu xili Bari Yesu xa di. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />A nu na mangɛ Sɛrigu Pɔlu sɛɛti ma, naxan xaxili nu fan. Na tan naxa Baranabasi nun Sɔlu xili, barima a nu wama Ala xa masenyi ramɛfe.<verse eid="ACT 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Kɔnɔ na duure e naxan ma Elimasi, a xili wama a masenfe a duure nan a ra, a naxa e matandi. A nu katafe nɛ alako a xa mangɛ xa ba danxaniya kira xɔn ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Awa Sɔlu, naxan man xili Pɔlu, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi to goro a ma, a naxa a ya banban a ra, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />a naxa a fala a bɛ, «Kalabante nun yanfante nan i ra. Ibulisa xa di, tinxintare, i mu bama Marigi xa kira tinxinxi dalinfe? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Awa yakɔsi, Marigi bara a bɛlɛxɛ sa i ma. I fama nɛ dɔnxude. Waxati nde bun ma, i mu soge toma.» Dimi naxa dusu a xun na keren na. A naxa so milimalafe na ma, a nu mixie fen naxee a yi rasuxuma. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Awa, mangɛ Sɛrigu Pɔlu to na to, a naxa danxaniya Marigi xa sɛriyɛ ma.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">E sigafe Pisidiya bɔxi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Pɔlu nun a booree to baki kunkui kui Pafosi, e naxa siga Pɛriga naxan na Panfiliya bɔxi ma. Yaya naxa a ba e ma, a naxa gbilen Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Mɛnni e naxa ti kira xɔn. E naxa so Antiyɔki naxan na Pisidiya bɔxi ma. E to so salide kui malabu lɔxɔɛ, e naxa e magoro. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Tawureta Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa Kitaabui xaranyi to ba a ra, salide xunmatie naxa xɛɛra ti e ma, e nu a fala, «Won ngaxakerenyie, xa marasi nde na wo yi ra ɲama bɛ, wo a fala.» <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Pɔlu to keli, a naxa e masabari, a fa a fala, «Isirayilakae nun wo tan naxee gaaxuxi Ala ya ra, wo wo tuli mati. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Isirayila ɲama Marigi Ala bara won babae sugandi. A naxa e rawuya Misira bɔxi ma. Na xanbi a naxa e ramini naa a sɛnbɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />A naxa e rabalo ɲɛ tongo naani ɲɔndɔn gbengberenyi ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />A to si solofere halaki Kanaan bɔxi ma, a naxa na bɔxie fi Isirayilakae ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Ɲɛ kɛmɛ naani ɲɛ tongo suuli bun ma, a naxa mangɛe ti e xun ma han Annabi Samuweli xa tɛmui. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Awa, e to wa mangɛ belebele xɔn ma, Ala naxa Kisu xa di, Sɔlu, naxan fatan Bunyamin bɔnsɔɛ ra, a naxa na ti e xun ma. A xa mangɛya naxa bu ɲɛ tongo naani. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />A to Sɔlu ba mangɛya ra, a naxa Dawuda findi mangɛ ra e xun. A yi seedeya masen na nan ma, ‹N bara Dawuda to, Yisayi xa di, naxan kɛɲa rafan n ma. A tan nan n sago birin nakamalima.›»<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />«Ala Isirayila Rakisima raminixi Dawuda bɔnsɔɛ nan ya ma, naxan lanxi Isa ma, alɔ a laayidi tongoxi ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Beenun Isa xa fa, Yaya nu bara mixie kawandi e xa tuubi, e xa e xunxa ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />A xa wali raɲɔn tɛmui, a naxa a fala, ‹N mu findixi mixi xa ra, wo naxan maɲɔxunxi. Na kanyi fama n xanbi ra. Na binyɛ mu na n yi ra n xa a xa sankiri mafulun.›»<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />«N ngaxakerenyie, Iburahima bɔnsɔɛ xa die nun wo tan naxee gaaxuma Ala ya ra, yi kisi masenyi rasanbaxi won tan nan ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Darisalamukae nun e xunmatie mu tin Isa ra. E mu fahaamui sɔtɔ namiɲɔnmɛe xa masenyi ma, naxan xaranma malabu lɔxɔɛ birin. Kɔnɔ e naxa na masenyi yati rakamali Isa tɔɔɲɛgɛfe ra. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Hali e to mu sese to a lanma a xa faxa naxan ma, e naxa Pilati maxandi a xa a faxa. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Na kui, e naxa fe birin nakamali naxee sɛbɛxi a xun. E man naxa a ragoro wuri magalanbuxi ma, e a fure sa gaburi kui. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Kɔnɔ Ala naxa a rakeli faxɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />Mixi gbegbe naxee Isa mati kelife Galile sigafe Darisalamu, nee naxa a to xi wuyaxi bun ma. Yakɔsi e bara findi a xa seedee ra ɲama tagi.»<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />«Awa, muxu tan fan yi xibaaru fanyi masenma nɛ wo bɛ, Ala laayidi naxan tongo won benbae bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Ala bara a rakamali won tan bɛ, e xa die. A bara Isa rakeli faxɛ ma alɔ a sɛbɛxi Yabura sora firin nde kui ki naxɛ. A naxɛ, ‹N ma di nan i ra. N bara findi i baba ra to.› <verse eid="ACT 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />A bara a rakeli faxɛ ma, alako a naxa bɔrɔ. A na nan masenxi yi ki, ‹Laayidi sɛniyɛnxie, naxee mu kanama, n naxee tongoxi Dawuda bɛ, n nee tongoma nɛ wo fan bɛ.› <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Na na a ra, a man na masenyi falaxi yire gbɛtɛ. A naxɛ, ‹I mu i xanuntenyi luma gaburi kui.› <verse eid="ACT 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Dawuda to gɛ Ala sago rabade a xa waxati, a faxa nɛ, a a benbae li gaburi kui, a man bɔrɔ naa. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Kɔnɔ Ala mixi naxan nakelixi faxɛ ma, na tan mu bɔrɔ.»<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />«N ngaxakerenyie, naxan kawandixi wo bɛ, wo xa a kolon yunubi xafarima a tan nan saabui ra. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Naxan yo danxaniya, na kanyi bara kisi yunubie ma, Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ mu nɔ wo rakiside naxee ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Na kui, wo wo mɛɛni naxan falaxi namiɲɔnmɛe xa Kitaabuie kui, a naxa fa wo li. E naxɛ, <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‹Wo a mato, wo tan mixi mayelee, wo dɛ xa ixara, wo bara lɔɛ, barima n fama kɛwali rabade wo xa lɔxɔɛe nan ma, wo mu lama naxan na hali e a yaba wo bɛ.›»<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Sɔlu nun Baranabasi to mini, mixie naxa e maxandi e man xa yi masenyi ti malabu lɔxɔɛ naxan man fama kɔrɛ. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Awa, ɲama to yensen, Yuwifi wuyaxi nun mixi naxee nu soxi Yuwifi xa diinɛ kui, nee naxa bira Pɔlu nun Baranabasi fɔxɔ ra. Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa e rasi e xa lu Ala xa hinnɛ kui. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Na malabu lɔxɔɛ xungbilenyi, taakae birin naxa e malan Ala xa masenyi ramɛde. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Yuwifie to ɲama to, tɔɔnɛ naxa e suxu. E naxa ti Pɔlu kanke, e nu a xa wɔyɛnyi matandi, e nu a konbi. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa a fala e bɛ ɲama tagi, «A lanma Ala xa masenyi xa masen wo tan nan singe bɛ, kɔnɔ wo bara tondi a ra. Na kui, wo yɛtɛ bara a fala a mu daxa wo xa kisi sɔtɔ. Yakɔsi muxu muxu ya rafindima si gbɛtɛe nan ma, <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />alɔ Marigi muxu yamarixi ki naxɛ. A naxɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‹N bara i ti i xa findi naiyalanyi ra sie bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">kisi xaninfe ra han duniɲa danyi.›»<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Mixi naxee mu findixi Yuwifi ra, nee to na mɛ, e naxa sɛɛwa. E naxa e Marigi xa wɔyɛnyi matɔxɔ. Naxee birin nu sugandixi kisi fe ra, nee naxa danxaniya.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Marigi xa masenyi naxa yensen bɔxi birin kui. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifie naxa ginɛ hagigɛe, naxee nu soxi Yuwifie xa diinɛ kui, nun na taa kuntigie, e naxa nee bɔɲɛe rate. E naxa tɔɔrɛ dɔxɔ Pɔlu nun Baranabasi ma han e naxa e keri e xa bɔxi ma. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa e sanyi rakonkon, na xa findi seede ra a lantareya na e tagi. Na xanbi e naxa siga Ikoniyon. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa sɛɛwa, e man nu fa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">E sigafe Ikoniyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa so Yuwifie xa salide kui Ikoniyon. E naxa wɔyɛn a fanyi ra han Yuwifie nun Girɛkika gbegbe naxa danxaniya. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifie naxee mu danxaniya, nee naxa Girɛkikae kui iso, alako e bɔɲɛ xa te danxaniyatɔɛe xili ma. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa tɛmui xɔnkuye raba Ikoniyon, e nu wɔyɛn lanlanteya kui. Marigi naxa tɔnxumae nun kaabanakoe raba e saabui ra, e tan naxee findixi seede ra Ala xa masenyi bɛ, a xa hinnɛ xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Taakae naxa itaxun dɔxɔ firin. Ndee naxa lu Yuwifie xa sɛɛti, ndee fan naxa lu xɛɛrae xa sɛɛti. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Girɛkikae nun Yuwifie nun e xa mangɛe naxa lan e xa fe ɲaaxi dɔxɔ e ma, e man xa e magɔnɔ han e xa faxa. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi to na kolon, e naxa e gi, e siga Likayoni taae kui, Lisitire nun Deribe, a nun na rabilinyi. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />E naxa xibaaru fanyi kawandi ti naa.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">E Sigafe Lisitire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Mixi nde nu dɔxɔxi Lisitire, namatɛ nan nu a ra, a bari na ki nɛ lanyuru kui. A mu nu nɔma a ɲɛrɛde hali keren. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />A nu a tuli matima Pɔlu xa masenyi nan na. Pɔlu naxa a ya ti a ra. A naxa a to a danxaniyaxi a yalan fe ma. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />A naxa a fala a xui itexi ra, «Keli, i ti i sanyie xun na. A naxa keli keren na, a ɲɛrɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Ɲama to na to, Pɔlu naxan nabaxi, e naxa a fala Likayoni xui, «Alae bara e falin mixie, e goro won tagi.» <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />E naxa xili nde xabu e xun, e Baranabasi xili naxa sa Seyusi, Pɔlu fan Heremɛsi, barima a tan nan nu wɔyɛnma. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Seyusi xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ, naxan xa salide nu na taa sode dɛ ra, na naxa fa tuurae nun fugee ra naadɛe biri ra. A tan nun ɲama naxa wa sɛrɛxɛ bafe e bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Xɛɛrae Baranabasi nun Pɔlu to na kolon, e naxa e xa sosee ibɔɔ, e man fa gbelegbele ɲama ra. <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />E naxa a fala, «Wo tan, munfe ra wo yi fe mɔɔli rabama? Mixi nan muxu ra, alɔ wo tan. Muxu faxi xibaaru fanyi nan na wo bɛ. Muxu wo rasima wo xa ba yi fufafu fee ma alako wo xa bira Ala xa kira fɔxɔ ra, naxan koore nun bɔxi, baa nun se birin daa. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Tɛmui dangixi Ala a lu nɛ si birin xa bira e yɛtɛ kan xa kirae fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Hali na birin kui, a nu fe fanyi rabama naxan findi seede ra a xa fe ra. Tunɛ ye nu fama keli koore ma. Sansie nu fanma a tɛmui alako wo xa balo, wo man xa sɛɛwa wo bɔɲɛ kui.» <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa kata ki fanyi ra alako e naxa sɛrɛxɛ ba e bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Awa, Yuwifie naxa fa keli Antiyɔki nun Ikoniyon. E naxa ɲama kui iso han e naxa Pɔlu magɔnɔ a xa faxa. E naxa mini a bubu ra taa fari ma barima e tan bɛ a bara gɛ faxade. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Kɔnɔ Isa fɔxirabirɛe to a rabilin, a naxa keli, a man naxa gbilen taa kui.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">E gbilenfe Antiyɔki Siriya bɔxi ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Kuye to iba, Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa siga Deribe. E to gɛ kawandi tide taa kui, mixi gbegbe naxa findi Isa fɔxirabirɛe ra. Na xanbi e naxa gbilen Lisitire, Ikoniyon, nun Antiyɔki. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />E nu Isa fɔxirabirɛe ralimaniya. E man nu e rasi e xa sabati danxaniya kui. E nu a fala, «Won mu soma Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma fo won xa tɔɔrɔ.» <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />E naxa kuntigie sugandi danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama keren keren ma bɛ. E to gɛ salide nun sunde, e naxa e taxu Marigi ra, e nu danxaniyaxi naxan ma. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Awa, e to Pisidiya igiri, e naxa fa Panfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />E naxa kawandi ti Pɛriga, e naxa goro Ataleya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />E to keli mɛnni, e naxa baki kunkui kui sigafe ra Antiyɔki, e nu taxuxi Ala xa hinnɛ ra dɛnnaxɛ. E nu bara gɛ na wali birin nabade. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />E to so, e naxa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama malan. E naxa fe birin dɛntɛgɛ sa e bɛ Ala naxan nabaxi e saabui ra, nun Ala danxaniya naadɛ rabixi si gbɛtɛe bɛ ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />E nun Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa bu e bore ra.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Darisalamu malanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Mixi ndee naxee keli Yudaya, e naxa a fala Isa fɔxirabirɛe bɛ, «Xa wo mu wo sunna Annabi Munsa xa naamunyi ki ma, wo mu nɔma kiside.» <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa wɔyɛnyi xɔrɔxɔɛ fala e bɛ. E naxa natɛ tongo Pɔlu nun Baranabasi nun mixi ndee xa te Darisalamu xɛɛrae nun kuntigie maxɔrinde yi fe ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama naxa e xɛɛ. E dangixi Fenisiya nun Samari ra tɛmui naxɛ, e naxa a masen mɛnnikae bɛ, mixi naxee kelixi si gbɛtɛe ma, nee danxaniyaxi ki naxɛ. Yi masenyi naxa Isa fɔxirabirɛe raɲɛlɛxin. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />E to so Darisalamu, danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama nun xɛɛrae, nun kuntigie naxa e rasɛnɛ. Ala naxan birin naba e saabui ra, e naxa na yaba e bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Awa, Farisɛni nde naxee nu bara danxaniya, e naxa keli, e nu fa a fala, a lanma nɛ si gbɛtɛ mixie xa sunna, e xa bira Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra.<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Xɛɛrae nun kuntigie naxa e malan e xa na fe mato. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />E to na fe isɔnxɔ sɔnxɔ, Piyɛri naxa keli, a a fala e bɛ, «N ngaxakerenyie, wo a kolon kafi tɛmui xɔnkuye Ala bara n sugandi wo tagi, alako si gbɛtɛ mixie xa xibaaru fanyi mɛ n dɛ ra, e xa danxaniya. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Awa, Ala naxan mixi sondonyi kolon, na bara seedeya raba e bɛ, a a Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi fi e ma alɔ won tan. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />A mu mixi yo rafisa a boore bɛ e tan nun won tan tagi, barima a bara e sondonyi rasɛniyɛn danxaniya ra. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Yakɔsi, munfe ra wo Ala matoma? Wo na kote dɔxɔfe Isa fɔxirabirɛe xun, won benbae nun won tan mu naxan nɔma. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Wo xa a kolon a won nakisixi Marigi Isa xa hinnɛ nan na alɔ e tan fan.»<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Ɲama birin naxa dundu, e naxa e tuli mati Pɔlu nun Baranabasi ra. Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa a tagi raba booree bɛ Ala kaabanakoe nun tɔnxumae naxee birin naba e saabui ra si gbɛtɛe tagi. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />E to gɛ wɔyɛnde, Yaki naxa wɔyɛnyi tongo, a naxɛ, <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />«N ngaxakerenyie, wo wo tuli mati n na. Simɔn bara a yaba Ala mixie sugandima ki naxɛ sie ya ma, a xili sama naxee xun ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Namiɲɔnmɛe birin xa masenyi lanxi na nan ma. A sɛbɛxi,<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‹Na xanbi n fama nɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Dawuda xa banxi biraxi rakelide.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">N na yire kanaxie rafalama nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">n na rakelima nɛ,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />alako mixi naxee luxi e xa nɔ Marigi fende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">si gbɛtɛ naxee birin findima n gbe ra.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Marigi xa masenyi nan na ki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:18">naxan yi fe kolon kabi a fɔlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:18">naxan yi fe birin nagirima.›»<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />«Na na a ra, a mu lanma a xa findi fe xɔrɔxɔɛ ra si gbɛtɛe bɛ naxee wama birafe Ala fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Kɔnɔ won xa bataaxɛ sɛbɛ e ma, e naxa see don naxee baxi sɛrɛxɛ ra kuyee bɛ. E man xa ba yɛnɛ ma, a nun e naxa sube yufaxi don, e man naxa wuli min. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Barima kabi won benbae xa waxati, mixie na taa birin kui, naxee Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ xaranma salidee kui malabu lɔxɔɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Awa, xɛɛrae nun kuntigie nun danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama birin naxa lan a ma e xa mixi ndee xɛɛ Antiyɔki, naxee Pɔlu nun Baranabasi matima. E naxa Yudasi naxan xili Barasaba, nun Silasi sugandi, xɛmɛ binyee ngaxakerenyie ya ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />E naxa bataaxɛ keren so e yi ra naxan sɛbɛxi, «Xɛɛrae nun kuntigie, naxee lanxi wo ngaxakerenyie ma, katarabi won ngaxakerenyie ma si gbɛtɛe ya ma, naxee na Antiyɔki, Siriya, nun Silisi, muxu bara wo xɛɛbu. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Muxu bara a mɛ a mixi ndee naxee kelixi muxu ya ma, muxu mu ɲungui saxi naxee ma, a nee bara wo rakɔntɔfili e xa wɔyɛnyi ra. E bara wo bɔɲɛ ifu.»<verse eid="ACT 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />«Na na a ra, muxu bara lan a ma muxu xa xɛɛrae xɛɛ wo ma, sa Pɔlu nun Baranabasi fari, muxu xanuntenyie, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />naxee bara mɛɛ e nii ra won Marigi Isa xa fe ra, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Muxu bara Yudasi nun Silasi fan xɛɛ, naxee yi fee tagi rabama wo bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi nun muxu tan bara lan a ma muxu naxa kote gbɛtɛ dɔxɔ wo xun fo naxan daxa. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />A tan nan yi ki: Wo naxa sube don naxan baxi sɛrɛxɛ ra kuyee bɛ, nun sube yufaxie, wo naxa wuli fan min. Wo man naxa yɛnɛ fan naba. Wo lan wo xa gbilen yi fe birin fɔxɔ ra. Wo salamu.»<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Awa, e to bara e ɲungu ɲama ma, e naxa siga Antiyɔki, e naxa sa bataaxɛ so danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama yi ra. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Ngaxakerenyie to a xaran, e naxa ɲɛlɛxin, e naxa limaniya. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yudasi nun Silasi, naxee yati nu findixi namiɲɔnmɛe ra, e naxa e kawandi, e nu e ralimaniya wɔyɛn wuyaxi ra. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Waxati nde to dangi, e ngaxakerenyie naxa e bɛɲin bɔɲɛsa kui gbilenfe e xɛɛmae ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Kɔnɔ Silasi tan naxa lu naa. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Pɔlu nun Baranabasi naxa lu Antiyɔki, e nun e boore wuyaxi e nu fa mixie xaran, e man nu Marigi xa xibaaru fanyi kawandi ti.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu nun Baranabasi fatanfe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Lɔxɔɛ ndee to dangi, Pɔlu naxa a fala Baranabasi bɛ, «Won xa gbilen taa birin kui won Marigi xa masenyi kawandixi dɛnnaxɛ, won xa a mato won ngaxakerenyie danxaniyatɔɛe na ki naxɛ naa.» <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Baranabasi nu wama Yaya fan xaninfe, naxan xili Maraki. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Kɔnɔ Pɔlu naxa a fala a mu lan e xa mixi xanin e xun ma naxan keli e xun ma Panfiliya, a mu tin birade e fɔxɔ ra e xa wali kui. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Na lantareya naxa xɔrɔxɔ han a naxa findi fatanyi ra. Baranabasi naxa Maraki tongo, e naxa baki kunkui kui sigafe ra Sipiri suri ma. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />E ngaxakerenyie to e taxu Marigi xa hinnɛ ra, Pɔlu naxa Silasi tongo, e naxa siga <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Siriya nun Silisi bɔxie ma, e danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae ralimaniya.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timote birafe Pɔlu nun Silasi fɔxɔ ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Pɔlu naxa siga Deribe nun Lisitire. Isa fɔxirabirɛ nde nu na, a xili Timote. Yuwifi ginɛ danxaniyatɔɛ nde xa di nan nu a ra. A baba Girɛkika nan nu a ra. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Lisitire nun Ikoniyon ngaxakerenyie nu a xili fanyi falama. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Pɔlu to wa a xaninfe a xun, a naxa a sunna Yuwifie xa fe ra naxee nu na mɛnni, barima birin nu a kolon a baba Girɛkika na a ra.<verse eid="ACT 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />E naxa xɛɛrae nun Isa fɔxirabirɛe kuntigi naxee nu na Darisalamu, e naxa nee xa natɛ masen danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ na taae kui, e xa a rabatu. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Danxaniyatɔɛ ɲamae xa danxaniya sɛnbɛ xun nu masama, danxaniyatɔɛ kɔnti fan xun nu masa lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu laamatunyi tofe Tiroyasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi to mu tin e xa kawandi ti Asi bɔxi ma, e naxa Firigiya nun Galati bɔxi igiri. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />E to makɔrɛ Misi bɔxi ra, e naxa wa sofe Bitiniya, kɔnɔ Isa Xaxili mu tin e xa siga naa. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Awa, e naxa Misi igiri, e naxa goro Tiroyasi. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Kɔɛ ra, Pɔlu naxa laamatunyi to. Masedonka nde naxa keli, a fa a maxandi, «Fa Masedon bɔxi ma, i xa fa muxu mali.» <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Pɔlu laamatunyi to xanbi, muxu naxa la a ra a Marigi bara muxu xili xibaaru fanyi kawandife ra naa. Muxu naxa kata sigafe ra Masedon keren na.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidi xunxafe ye xɔɔra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Muxu to keli Tiroyasi, muxu naxa baki kunkui kui, muxu naxa muxu ya rafindi Samotirasi ma keren na. Na kuye iba, muxu naxa ti Neyapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Muxu to keli naa, muxu naxa siga Filipi, Masedon taa singe. E nu na Rɔmakae xa mangɛya nan bun ma. Muxu naxa saxanyi radangi na taa kui.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Malabu lɔxɔɛ, muxu naxa siga taa fari ma xure dɛ ra, muxu dɛnnaxɛ maɲɔxun salide ra. Muxu to dɔxɔ, muxu naxa wɔyɛn ginɛe ra naxee nu malanxi naa. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ginɛ nde nu na e ya ma naxan xili Lidi, garɛ dugi mati. Tiyatireka nan nu a ra. A gaaxu Ala ya ra. A to a tuli mati, Marigi naxa a bɔɲɛ rabi alako Pɔlu naxan falama a xa so a xaxili ma. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />A to a xunxa ye xɔɔra, a nun a xa denbaya, a naxa muxu mayandi, «Xa wo sa laxi a ra n bara danxaniya Marigi ma, wo fa lu n ma banxi kui yi saxanyi.» A naxa muxu karaxan mayandi ra.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">E na geeli kui Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Muxu to nu sigama salide, konyi ginɛ nde naxa fa muxu ya ra. Ɲinnɛ kanyi nan nu a ra, ɲinnɛ naxan xili Tinɛ, naxan se matoma. Na ginɛ nu naafuli xungbe rasoma a kanyie ma. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />A naxa so birafe muxu fɔxɔ ra, Pɔlu nun muxu tan. A nu sɔnxɔɛ rate, «Yi mixie Ala Xili Xungbe Kanyi xa konyie nan e ra. E wo tife kisi kira nan xɔn ma.» <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />A naxa na raba xi wuyaxi. Pɔlu to xɔnɔ, a naxa a ya rafindi, a naxa a fala ɲinnɛ bɛ, «N bara i yamari Isa xili ra, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi, gbilen yi ginɛ fɔxɔ ra.» Ɲinnɛ naxa gbilen a fɔxɔ ra keren na.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Na konyi ginɛ kanyie to a to e xa geeni bara kana, e naxa Pɔlu nun Silasi suxu. E naxa e xanin kiitisae yire. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />E naxa e dɛntɛgɛ kiitisae bɛ, e naxɛ, «Yi mixie nan won ma taa ya isofe. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Yuwifi nan e ra naxee naamunyie xa fe masenma won mu tinxi naxee ra, won tan Rɔmakae.» <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Ɲama fan naxa keli e ra, nun kiitisae. E naxa e makoyɛn, e naxa yaamari fi e xa e bɔnbɔ luxusinyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />E to gɛ e bɔnbɔde, e naxa e woli geeli kui. E naxa kɔsibili yamari a xa e kanta a fanyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Na kɔsibili to na yaamari sɔtɔ, a naxa Pɔlu nun Silasi sa geeli kui, a yɔlɔnxɔnyie sa e ma. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Kɔɛ tagi to a li, Pɔlu nun Silasi nu Ala maxandife, e nu Ala matɔxɔfe bɛɛti ra. Geelimanie nu e xui mɛxi. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Bɔxi naxa sɛrɛn keren na, geeli sanbunyi naxa a ramaxa. Na tɛmui kerenyi kui, naadɛ birin naxa rabi. Geelimanie birin xa yɔlɔnxɔnyie naxa mabolon. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Kɔsibili naxa xunu. A to geeli naadɛe to e rabixi, a naxa a xa santidɛgɛma bɛndun a tɛɛ a xa a yɛtɛ faxa, a ɲɔxɔ a ma a geelimanie nu bara e gi.<verse eid="ACT 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Kɔnɔ Pɔlu naxa sɔnxɔ a xui itexi ra, «I naxa fe xɔnɛ niya i yɛtɛ ra, muxu birin na be.» <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Awa, kɔsibili to tɛ maxili, a naxa so mafuren. A naxa a xinbi sin Pɔlu nun Silasi bun ma, a sɛrɛnma. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />A naxa e ramini, a e maxɔrin, «Marigie, a lanma n xa munse raba alako n xa kisi?» <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Pɔlu nun Silasi naxa a yaabi, «I xa danxaniya Marigi Isa ma. Na nan a toma i kisima, i tan nun i xa denbaya.» <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />E naxa Marigi xa wɔyɛnyi masen a bɛ a nun a xa mixie. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />A naxa e xanin a xun ma keren na kɔɛ kui, a naxa e xa fie yae xa. Na waxati yati a naxa xunxa ye xɔɔra, a tan nun a xa mixi birin. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />A naxa e yigiya a xa banxi kui, a man fa donse fi e ma. A naxa ɲɛlɛxin a fanyi ra, a nun a xa denbaya birin barima e bara danxaniya Ala ma.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Kuye to iba, kiitisae naxa sɔɔrie xɛɛ e xa sa a fala kɔsibili bɛ a xa na mixie rabolo. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Kɔsibili naxa a fala Pɔlu bɛ, «Kiitisae bara xɛɛra ti a wo xa rabɛɲin. Awa, yakɔsi wo mini, wo xa siga bɔɲɛsa kui.» <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Kɔnɔ Pɔlu naxa a fala sɔɔrie bɛ, «Muxu tan naxee findixi Rɔmakae ra, e bara muxu sa geeli e mu muxu makiiti. E naxa muxu sa geeli, yakɔsi e wama muxu raminife gundo ra? Na mu lanma feo! E yɛtɛ yati nan fama muxu rabolode.» <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Sɔɔrie naxa yi wɔyɛnyie ragbilen kiitisae ma. E to a mɛ a Rɔmakae nan e ra, e naxa gaaxu. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />E naxa fa e mayandi, e e rabolo. E fan naxa e maxandi a e xa keli na taa.<verse eid="ACT 16:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />E to mini geeli kui, e naxa so Lidi xɔnyi. E to bara gɛ e ngaxakerenyie ralimaniyade, e naxa siga.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">E sigafe Tɛsaloniki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Pɔlu nun Silasi to dangi Anfipoli nun Apoloniya ra, e naxa so Tɛsaloniki taa kui, Yuwifie xa salide nde nu na dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Pɔlu naxa so naa alɔ a darixi naxan na. Malabu lɔxɔɛ xi saxan bun ma, e nun Pɔlu naxa Kitaabui xa fe fala. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />A nu a tagi raba e bɛ a a lanma Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa tɔɔrɔ ki naxɛ, a man xa keli faxɛ ma. A naxa a fala, «Isa, n naxan ma fe falafe wo bɛ yi ki, a tan nan Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra.» <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Ndee naxa la a ra e ya ma. E naxa bira Pɔlu nun Silasi fɔxɔ ra. Girɛkika gbegbe fan naxee nu gaaxuxi Ala ya ra, nee fan naxa la a ra, e nun ginɛ hagigɛ gbegbe. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifi tɔɔnɛxi ndee naxa mixi ɲaaxi ndee tongo e xa ɲama ya iso taa kui. E naxa siga Yason xɔnyi Pɔlu nun Silasi fende alako e xa e xanin kiitisae xɔn ma. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />E to mu e to, e naxa Yason nun a ngaxakerenyie ndee mabɛndun na taa kiitisae yire. E nu sɔnxɔɛ rate, e naxɛ, «Yi mixie naxee duniɲa ifuma, e bara fa be fan. Yason bara e yigiya. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />E birin Rɔmaka mangɛ xa wɔyɛnyi nan gbesen bama, e man a falama a mangɛ gbɛtɛ nde na naxan xili Isa.» <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />E naxa ɲama nun kiitisae bɔɲɛ rate na wɔyɛnyie ra. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Beenun e xa Yason nun a booree bɛɲin, fo e to kɔbiri ba.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">E sigafe Beere taa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Na kɔɛ ra, e ngaxakerenyie naxa Pɔlu nun Silasi rasiga Beere taa. E to so naa, e naxa so Yuwifie xa salide kui. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Na Yuwifie xaxili nu matinse dangi Tɛsalonikikae ra. E ɲan gbata nɛ na masenyi kolonde, e man Kitaabui kui mato lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ alako e xa a kolon e naxan falama e bɛ xa nɔndi yati nan a ra. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Yuwifi wuyaxi naxa danxaniya e ya ma, nun Girɛkika ginɛ gorobonɛ wuyaxi, nun xɛmɛ wuyaxi.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifie Tɛsalonikikae to a kolon a Pɔlu na Ala xa wɔyɛnyi kawandife Beere taa fan, e naxa fa naa, e fa ɲama ya iso. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Awa, danxaniyatɔɛe naxa Pɔlu tongo keren na, e naxa siga a ra baa fɛ ma, kɔnɔ Silasi nun Timote naxa lu Beere taa. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Naxee Pɔlu mati, e naxa siga a ra han Atɛn. Na xanbi e naxa gbilen e ɲungui ra Silasi nun Timote xɔn ma, e xa Pɔlu li sinnanyi ma Atɛn.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu kawandi tife Atɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Pɔlu nu Silasi nun Timote mamɛfe Atɛn. A bɔɲɛ naxa maɲaaxu a ra na taa xa kuyee xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Na kui, a naxa dɛ masara e nun Yuwifie ra, a nun mixie naxee gaaxuxi Ala ya ra salide kui. A man naxa wɔyɛn mixie ra a naralanma naxee ra malan yire taa kui lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Epikuri nun Sitoyisi karamɔxɔe naxa so wɔyɛnfe Pɔlu ra, e nu a fala, «Yi wɔyɛnla munse falafe?» Ndee to Pɔlu xui mɛ a Isa xa xibaaru masenma, a man nu fa marakeli fee falafe, e naxɛ, «A luxi nɛ alɔ a ala gbɛtɛe nan ma fee falama.»<verse eid="ACT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Awa, e naxa a tongo, e naxa siga a ra Areyopago malan yire, e naxa a maxɔrin, «Yi lɔnni nɛɛnɛ i naxan masenma, muxu nɔma a kolonde di? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Barima muxu fe nɛɛnɛ nan mɛfe yi ki, muxu wama na fasari nan kolonfe.» <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Atɛnkae nun xɔɲɛe naxee sabatixi Atɛn, e nu darixi e tuli matife ra wɔyɛn nɛɛnɛ ra naxee masenma.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Pɔlu naxa ti Areyopago tagi, a naxa a fala, «Atɛnkae, n bara a to diinɛlae yati yati nan wo ra. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />N bara see to wo naxee batuma. N man bara sɛrɛxɛbade nde to, a sɛbɛxi naxan ma, ‹Ala naxan mu kolonxi!› Wo naxan batuma, a fa lu wo mu a kolon, n na nan ma fe masenfe wo bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Ala naxan duniɲa daaxi, a nun se naxan birin na a kui, a tan naxan koore nun bɔxi Marigi ra, a mu sabatixi banxi kui mixi bɛlɛxɛ naxan nafalaxi. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />A hayi mu na see ma adama naxan xaninma a xɔn ma. A tan nan baloe nun ɲɛngi nun se birin fima mixi ma. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />A tan nan a niya mixi birin xa mini benba keren fate. A naxa e rasabati bɔxi birin ma. A man naxa e xa waxati nun e lude naaninyie sa, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />alako e xa Ala fen, e xa kata a kolonde, hali a to mu makuya won na. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Wo xa lɔnnilae yati fan bara a fala, ‹Won baloxi a tan nɛ, won fe birin nabama a tan nan saabui ra, nun won minixi a tan nɛ. A bɔnsɔɛ nan won na.› <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Awa xa won kelixi a bɔnsɔɛ nɛ, a mu lanma won xa a maɲɔxun a Ala maniyaxi xɛɛma, gbeti, xa na mu gɛmɛ nan na, mixi bɛlɛxɛ naxan solixi e xaxili ra. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ala mu nu na fe kolontareya tɛmui matoxi, kɔnɔ yakɔsi a bara a fala mixi birin bɛ, yire birin, e xa tuubi, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />barima a bara lɔxɔɛ keren sugandi, a fama duniɲa makiitide naxan ma tinxinyi ra, mixi nde saabui ra a bara a ragiri naxan ma. A bara na kanyi matɔnxumaxi rakeli faxamixie ya ma.» <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />E to yi fe mɛ, fa a fala mixi kelima faxɛ ma, ndee naxa so a mayelefe. Ndee naxa a fala, «Muxu fama muxu tuli matide i ra lɔxɔɛ gbɛtɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Awa, Pɔlu naxa mini e ya ma. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Ndee naxa lu a mabiri ra, e naxa danxaniya, alɔ Denisiyo, naxan nu na Areyopago mixie ya ma, nun ginɛ nde naxan xili Damarisi, e nun mixi gbɛtɛe ra.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">E sigafe Korinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Na xanbi, Pɔlu naxa keli Atɛn, a naxa siga Korinti. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />A naxa Yuwifi keren li naa, a xili Akila, Pontuka nan a ra. A nu baxi fade keli Itali a nun a xa ginɛ Pirisila, barima Kilɔdi nu bara Yuwifi birin yaamari e xa mini Rɔma. Pɔlu naxa kafu e ma, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />barima e nu wali keren nan nabama, kiri banxi rafalafe. A naxa lu e xɔnyi, e nu wali naa. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Pɔlu nu wɔyɛnma salide kui malabu lɔxɔɛ birin. A nu Yuwifie nun Girɛkikae radanxaniya. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Silasi nun Timote to so, keli Masedon, Pɔlu naxa a yɛtɛ fi kawandi rabafe gbansan ma. A nu a fala Yuwifie bɛ a Isa nan Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifie to na matandi konbi ra, Pɔlu naxa a xa donma ikonkon tɔnxuma ra, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Xa wo lɔɛ, wo tan nan fɔxi na na ra. N tan bara na kote ba n xun. Yakɔsi n sigama nɛ si gbɛtɛe ma.»<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />A to keli naa, a naxa so mixi nde xɔnyi, a kanyi xili Titi Yusutu, a gaaxu Ala ya ra. A xa banxi nu na salide fɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Na tɛmui, Kirisipu salide xunmati naxa danxaniya Marigi ma a nun a xa denbaya birin. Korintikae wuyaxi naxee nu Pɔlu xui mɛxi, e fan naxa danxaniya, e naxa e xunxa ye xɔɔra.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Marigi naxa a fala Pɔlu bɛ laamatunyi ra kɔɛ kui, «I naxa gaaxu muku! Wɔyɛn! I naxa dundu, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />barima n na i fɔxɔ ra. Mixi yo bɛlɛxɛ mu i lima a xa fe ɲaaxi raba i ra, barima mixi gbegbe na n bɛ yi taa kui.» <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Pɔlu naxa lu naa ɲɛ keren kike senni. A nu Korintikae xaran Ala xa masenyi ra.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Galiyon to nu na Akayi mangɛ ra, Yuwifie naxa yanfanteya xiri Pɔlu xun, e naxa a xanin kiitisae yire. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />E naxa a fala, «Yi di nan mixie kui isoma e xa Ala batu ki gbɛtɛ naxan mu sɛriyɛ ki ra.» <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Pɔlu to wɔyɛn fɔlɔ, Galiyon naxa a fala Yuwifie bɛ, «Xa a sa li tinxintareya na a ra, xa na mu a ra wali kobi nde, n n tuli matima nɛ wo ra nu, <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />kɔnɔ xa a sa li boore matandi na a ra wɔyɛnyi ma, xa na mu a ra xilie ma, a nun wo xa sɛriyɛ ma, na na wo tan nan ma. N mu wama findife na fe makiitima ra.» <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Na kui, a naxa e keri kiiti banxi kui. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Ɲama naxa salide xunmati Sositene suxu, e a bɔnbɔ kiiti banxi tande ma, kɔnɔ Galiyon mu e hansa.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">E gbilenfe Antiyɔki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Pɔlu to bu Korinti ki fanyi ra, a naxa keli a ngaxakerenyie xun ma. A naxa baki kunkui kui a nun Pirisila nun Akila, e siga Siriya. A naxa a xunyi bi Senxereya, barima a nu bara laayidi tongo Ala bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />E to so Efɛsɛ, Pɔlu naxa a ɲɛrɛbooree lu naa. A naxa so salide kui, e nun Yuwifie naxa sumun. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />E naxa a mayandi a xa bu naa, <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />kɔnɔ na mu a xunyi suxu. A naxa a ɲungu e ma. A naxɛ, «Fo n xa sa sali Darisalamu nɛ. Xa Ala tin, n man fama wo xɔnyi.» <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Awa, a naxa baki kunkui kui, a keli Efɛsɛ, a siga Sesare. A to gɛ danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama xɛɛbude, a naxa goro Antiyɔki.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu xa biyaasi saxan nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Pɔlu to bara saxanyi radangi Antiyɔki, a naxa kira tongo, a naxa Galati nun Firigiya bɔxi birin isa, a nu Isa fɔxirabirɛe ralimaniya.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Apolosi, Yuwifi nde naxan barixi Alesandire, a naxa Efɛsɛ li. A nu fata wɔyɛnde, a Kitaabui fan kolon. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />A nu xaranxi Marigi xa kiraya ra. A naxa Isa xa fe masen a fanyi ra, kɔnɔ a nu Yaya xa xaranyi nan gbansan kolon xunxa tife ye xɔɔra. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />A naxa so wɔyɛnfe a rawasaxi ra salide kui. Akila nun Pirisila to a xui mɛ, e naxa kafu a ma alako e xa Ala xa kiraya masen a bɛ a ki ma. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Na xanbi a to nu wama dangife Akayi, a ngaxakerenyie naxa a ralimaniya. E naxa bataaxɛ sɛbɛ Isa fɔxirabirɛe ma a e xa a rasɛnɛ. A xa sigɛ naxa findi fe fanyi ra danxaniyatɔɛe bɛ Akayi bɔxi ma, naxee danxaniya Ala xa hinnɛ saabui ra. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Apolosi naxa Yuwifie matandi sɛnbɛ ra kɛnɛ ma, a naxa a masen Kitaabui ra a Isa nan Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ra.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Pɔlu sigafe Efɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolosi nu na Korinti. Pɔlu to bara gɛ Asi fuge biri isade, a naxa fa Efɛsɛ. A to naralan Isa fɔxirabirɛ ndee ra, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />a naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo bara Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi sɔtɔ wo to danxaniya?» E naxa a yaabi, «Muxu ɲan mu nu na mɛ sinden xa Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi na na.» <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />A naxa e maxɔrin, «Wo wo xunxa ye xɔɔra munfe ma?» E naxa a yaabi, «Muxu bara muxu xunxa ye xɔɔra alɔ Yaya a masenxi ki naxɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Awa, Pɔlu naxa a fala, «Yaya nu mixi xunxama ye xɔɔra nɛ tuubi xa fe ra. A nu a fala mixie bɛ, e xa danxaniya mixi nde ma naxan fama a tan xanbi ra. Na nan lanxi Isa ma.» <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Na masenyi ma e naxa e xunxa ye xɔɔra Marigi Isa xili ra. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Pɔlu to a bɛlɛxɛ sa e ma, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa fa e ma. E naxa so xui gbɛtɛe falafe, e man nu Ala xa masenyi fala. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />E birin nalanxi, xɛmɛ fu nun firin nan nu e ra.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Na dangi xanbi, Pɔlu naxa so salide kui, a kawandi ti. A nu fe tagi raba e bɛ Ala xa mangɛya niini xa fe ra kike saxan bun ma. A nu kata a xa mixie nɔ naxee tuli nu matixi a ra. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Kɔnɔ ndee xaxili nu xɔrɔxɔ, e mu la a ra. E naxa Marigi xa kira bɛxu ɲama ya i. Pɔlu naxa mini e ya ma, a naxa Isa fɔxirabirɛe tongo a xun, alako a xa e xaran lɔxɔ yo lɔxɔ Tiranusi xa xarande kui. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Na naxa siga han ɲɛ firin. Yuwifie nun Girɛkika naxee birin nu sabatixi Asi, e Marigi xa masenyi ramɛ na nan kui. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Ala nu kaabanako xungbee rabama Pɔlu bɛlɛxɛe ra <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />han e nu dugi nun xunxurie sa furemae ma, Pɔlu nu bara din naxee ra. Fure nu ba nɛ e ma, ɲinnɛ nu mini mixie i.<verse eid="ACT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Seba xa Die</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Yuwifie ndee naxee ɲinnɛ raminima mixie yire birin, e naxa kata Marigi Isa xili rawalide ɲinnɛ kanyie bɛ. E a fala, «N bara wo yaamari Isa xili ra Pɔlu naxan xa fe kawandima.» <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Seba, Yuwifie sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi nde, xa di solofere nan nu na fe rabama. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ɲinnɛ naxa e yaabi, «N Isa nun Pɔlu kolon, kɔnɔ n mu wo tan kolon feo!» <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Na ɲinnɛ kanyi naxa bagan e ma, a naxa e bɔnbɔ han e naxa e gi banxi kui e rageli nun e maxɔnɔxi ra.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Yuwifi nun Girɛkika naxee birin nu sabatixi Efɛsɛ, e naxa na fe kolon. Gaaxui naxa e birin suxu. Marigi Isa xili dariyɛ naxa mate. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Danxaniyatɔɛ wuyaxi naxa fa, e naxa e ti e xa yunubie ra, e naxa e xa fe ɲaaxi birin fala kɛnɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Duuree fan naxa fa e xa bukie ra, e naxa e gan birin ya xɔri. E naxa bukie sare kɔnti, kɔbiri kole wulu tongo suuli nan nu a ra. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Marigi xa masenyi nu yiriwama na ki nɛ sɛnbɛ ra.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Girinbanyi birafe Efɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Yi fee to dangi, Pɔlu naxa natɛ tongo a xa siga Darisalamu. Na biyaasi kui fo a xa Masedon nun Akayi bɔxi ibolon. A naxa a fala, «N na siga Darisalamu, fo n xa Rɔma fan li.» <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />A naxa a malima firin xɛɛ Masedon, Timote nun Erasito, kɔnɔ a tan naxa lu Asi sinden.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Na tɛmui sɔnxɔɛ xungbe naxa raba naa Marigi xa kira xa fe ma. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Xabui nde, naxan xili Demetiri, a nu ala Aritemi xa salide misaali lanmadi yailanma gbeti ra. Na xabui mɔɔlie nu kɔbiri gbegbe sɔtɔma na wali kui. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />A naxa a walibooree malan, a a fala e bɛ, «Wo a kolon, won baloxi yi wali nan kui. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Wo bara a to, wo bara a mɛ, yi Pɔlu bara mixi gbegbe madaxu Asi bɔxi birin ma, Efɛsɛ gbansan xa mu a ra. A naxɛ a alae naxee rafalaxi mixie bɛlɛxɛ ra, a ala mu e ra. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Na kui won ma wali fama nɛ xili ɲaaxi sɔtɔde. Won ma ala Aritemi xa salide fan xun nakanama nɛ. Nde bama nɛ Aritemi xa binyɛ ra Asi bɔxi nun duniɲa ma.»<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />A to na fala, e naxa xɔnɔ, e naxa so sɔnxɔɛ ratefe, «Efɛsɛkae xa ala Aritemi nan gbo.» <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Taa birin ya naxa iso. E naxa Gayu nun Arisitaraki, Pɔlu ɲɛrɛboore Masedonkae, xanin malande xungbe kui. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Pɔlu naxa wa sigafe naa, kɔnɔ Isa fɔxirabirɛe mu tin. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />A booree Asikae xunmatie fan naxa xɛɛra ti Pɔlu ma, e a mayandi a naxa siga malan yire. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Ndee nu sɔnxɔma e gbe ki ma. Booree fan sɔnxɔma e gbe ki. Lantareya nu na malanyi ya ma. Mixi wuyaxi mu nu a kolon e malanxi fe naxan ma.<verse eid="ACT 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Awa, Yuwifie naxa Alesandire tutun yare a xa wɔyɛn. A naxa ɲama masabari a bɛlɛxɛ ra alako a xa masenyi ti. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Kɔnɔ, e to a kolon a Yuwifi nan a ra, e birin nalanxi naxa sɔnxɔɛ rate lɛɛri firin bun ma. E naxɛ, «Efɛsɛkae xa ala Aritemi nan gbo.» <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Na xanbi, taa kuntigi nde naxa ɲama masabari, a naxa a fala, «Efɛsɛkae, duniɲa birin a kolon a Efɛsɛ taa nan Aritemi xa salide kantama a nun Aritemi maniyɛ, naxan goroxi keli koore ma. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Mixi yo mu na matandima. A lanma wo xa dundu. Wo naxa gbata fefe rabade. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Wo bara fa yi mixie ra be, kɔnɔ e mu Aritemi muɲa, e mu a konbi. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Xa Demetiri nun a walibooree wama mixi nde kalamufe, e xa na masen kiitisae bɛ kiiti lɔxɔɛe. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Xa wo wama fe gbɛtɛ nan xɔn, na fan ya ibama won ma malan lɔxɔɛ. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />E nɔma won suxude won ma bɔɲɛte ma naxan dangixi to, barima nɔndi yo mu na won bɛ yi malanyi rabafe ma.» A to gɛ, a naxa malanyi rayensen.<verse eid="ACT 19:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">A sigafe Masedon nun Girɛki bɔxie ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Sɔnxɔɛ to bara ɲɔn, Pɔlu naxa Isa fɔxirabirɛe malan e rasife ma. A to a ɲungu e ma, a naxa siga Masedon. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />A naxa na bɔxi isa, a nu Isa fɔxirabirɛe rasi marasi wuyaxi ra. Na dangi xanbi, a naxa siga Girɛki bɔxi ma. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />A to lu naa kike saxan, a naxa wa sigafe Siriya kunkui kui, kɔnɔ Yuwifie nu bara yanfanteya yailan a xili ma. Na kui, a naxa natɛ tongo a xa gbilen Masedon kira ra. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Naxee a mati han Asi nee nan yi ki: Sopateri, Beereka Pirusi xa di, Arisitaraki nun Sekondu Tɛsalonikikae, Gayu Deribeka nun Timote, Tikike nun Tirofimo Asikae. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Nee naxa ti yare, e naxa sa muxu mamɛ Tiroyasi. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Taami Lɛbinitare Sali lɔxɔɛ dangi xanbi, muxu naxa baki kunkui kui Filipi. Beenun xi suuli, muxu naxa e li Tiroyasi. Muxu naxa lu naa xi solofere.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu Eyutiki rakelife faxɛ ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Sande lɔxɔɛ muxu naxa malan taami igirafe ra. Pɔlu naxa kawandi ti Isa fɔxirabirɛe bɛ han kɔɛ tagi. A lan nɛ a xa siga kuye na iba. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Lanpui gbegbe nu na na koore banxi kui, muxu nu malanxi dɛnnaxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Sɛgɛtala nde naxan xili Eyutiki nu dɔxɔxi wundɛri ra. Pɔlu xa kawandi xɔn to kuya, xi xɔli naxa a suxu a fanyi ra, a bira bɔxi ma kelife banxi dɛki saxan nde. E naxa a li, a bara faxa. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Pɔlu to goro, a naxa a felen a xun. A naxa a tongo, a a fala e bɛ, «Wo naxa kɔntɔfili, barima a mu faxaxi.» <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Pɔlu to te, a naxa taami igira, a naxa a don. A man naxa wɔyɛn han gɛɛsɛgɛ. Na gɛɛsɛgɛ, a naxa siga. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Danxaniyatɔɛe naxa sɛgɛtala xanin a ɲiɲɛ ra bɔɲɛsa kui.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu a ɲungufe Efɛsɛkae ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Muxu naxa kunkui bɛla rakeli sigafe ra Asosi Pɔlu ya ra alɔ muxu lanxi a ma ki naxɛ. A naxa wa sigafe a sanyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />A to muxu li Asosi, muxu naxa a baki kunkui kui sigafe Mitilɛni. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Keli mɛnni, muxu naxa siga baa kira ra. Na fan kuye iba, muxu naxa Kiyo li. Na xanbi, muxu naxa siga han Samosi. Na lɔxɔɛ kuye iba, muxu naxa Mileto li. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Pɔlu nu bara natɛ tongo a xa dangi Efɛsɛ mabiri alako a naxa bu Asi bɔxi ma. A nu gbataxi a xa so Darisalamu Xɛ Xabɛ Sali lɔxɔɛ xa a sa sɔɔnɛyama a bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Pɔlu to Mileto li, a naxa xɛɛra ti a Efɛsɛ danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama kuntigie xa fa. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />E to fa a yire, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo a kolon n ɲɛrɛxi wo tagi ki naxɛ. Kabi n so Asi, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />n Marigi xa wali raba yɛtɛ magoroe nan kui. N yaye bara mini, n bara tɔɔrɔ Yuwifie xa wali ɲaaxi saabui ra. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Wo a kolon a n mu wo munafan se yo nɔxun wo ma. N bara kawandi ti wo bɛ kɛnɛ ma nun wo xa banxie kui. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />N nu a falama nɛ Yuwifie nun Girɛkikae bɛ e xa togondiya Ala ma, e xa danxaniya won Marigi Isa, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi ma.»<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />«Yakɔsi Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi wama nɛ n xa siga Darisalamu, kɔnɔ n mu a kolon naxan sigama n sɔtɔde naa. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Taa birin kui Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi bara n nakolon a geeli nun tɔɔrɛ fama nɛ n lide naa. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Kɔnɔ n nii tide yo mu na n bɛ. N xa n ma xɛɛraya rakamali, n Marigi Isa naxan taxuxi n na. N xa findi Ala xa hinnɛ seedeɲɔxɔya ba ra, naxan findixi xibaaru fanyi ra.»<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />«Yakɔsi n a kolon wo mu n yatagi toma sɔnɔn, wo tan naxee birin wo tuli matixi n ma kawandi ra, Ala xa mangɛya niini xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Na na a ra, n a falama wo bɛ to, wo xa kote yo mu na n xun, <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />barima n bara Ala sago birin masen wo bɛ, n mu sese nɔxun wo ma. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Awa, wo xa mɛɛni wo yɛtɛ ma a nun danxaniyatɔɛ birin, Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi wo findixi naxee xa xunmati ra, alako wo xa mɛɛni Marigi xa danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama ma, a naxan sɔtɔxi a yɛtɛ wuli ra. Wo xa e kanta alɔ xurusee dɛmadonyi gɔɔrɛ kantama ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />N na kolon, n na siga, mixi ɲaaxie fama nɛ sode wo tagi, alɔ wula baree soma gɔɔrɛ ya ma ki naxɛ. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Mixi ndee soma wo tagi, e xa xaranyi ɲaaxi ti alako e xa Isa fɔxirabirɛe bɛndun e ma. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Wo xa wo mɛɛni. Wo xa ratu yi ɲɛ saxanyi bun ma n mu wo kawandife iti kɔɛ nun yanyi. N na birin nabaxi yaye nan kui.»<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />«Awa yakɔsi, n wo taxuma Ala ra nun a xa hinnɛ masenyi ra, naxan nɔma sɛnbɛ nun kɛ fanyi fide sɛniyɛntɔɛ birin ma. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />N mu nu wama wo xa kɔbiri xa xɔn, xa na mu a ra wo xa xɛɛma, wo xa sosee. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Wo yɛtɛ yati a kolon a n wali yi bɛlɛxɛe nan na alako n xa balo n nun n ɲɛrɛbooree. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />N bara a masen wo bɛ mɔɔli birin na, a won lan nɛ won xa wali alako won xa setaree mali. Wo xa ratu Marigi Isa xa wɔyɛnyi ma, a naxɛ, ‹Ɲɛlɛxinyi na ki nan kui, dangife a sɔtɔfe ra.›»<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />A to gɛ wɔyɛnde, a naxa a xinbi sin, e birin naxa Ala maxandi. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />E birin naxa so wafe. E naxa findigilin Pɔlu kɔnyi ma, e a masunbu. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />E sunnun nɛ barima a bara a fala e mu nɔma a tode sɔnɔn. E naxa a mati han kunkui dɛ ra.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pɔlu sigafe Darisalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Muxu to fatan, muxu naxa siga keren na Kosi kunkui kui. Na kuye iba, muxu naxa siga Rodi. Muxu to keli Rodi, muxu naxa siga Patara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Muxu to kunkui to naa, naxan nu baa igirife sigafe Fenisiya biri ra, muxu naxa baki na kui. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Muxu to bara Sipiri suri to, muxu naxa dangi na ra kɔɔla ma, sigafe Siriya biri ra. Muxu naxa ti Tire alako kote xa ragoro. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Muxu naxa Isa fɔxirabirɛe ndee li naa. Muxu naxa xi solofere radangi e xɔnyi. Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi naxa goro Isa fɔxirabirɛe ma, e xa a fala Pɔlu bɛ a naxa te Darisalamu.<verse eid="ACT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Kɔnɔ xi solofere kamali lɔxɔɛ, muxu naxa kira tongo sigafe ra. E birin naxa muxu mati, a nun e xa ginɛe nun e xa die ra, han taa fari ma. Muxu naxa muxu xinbi sin baa dɛ ra Ala maxandife ra. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Ɲungui to ɲɔn, muxu naxa baki kunkui kui. Booree tan naxa gbilen e xɔnyi. <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Muxu naxa keli Tire sigafe ra Pitolomayi. Muxu naxa ngaxakerenyie xɛɛbu mɛnni, muxu naxa fɛɛɲɛn naa.<verse eid="ACT 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Na kuye iba, muxu naxa siga Sesare, Filipu xibaaru fanyi kawandila xɔnyi, naxan nu na mixi sugandixi solofere ya ma. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />A xa di ginɛ naani nu na naxee mu nu dɔxɔ xɛmɛ taa. E nu namiɲɔnmɛ wali rabama. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Muxu to bara xi wuyaxi raba naa, Ala xa namiɲɔnmɛ naxan xili Agabu, naxa fa muxu xɔnyi kelife Yudaya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />A naxa Pɔlu xa bɛlɛti tongo, a naxa a yɛtɛ kan sanyie nun a bɛlɛxɛe xiri. A naxa a fala, «Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi yi nan masenxi. Xɛmɛ naxan gbe yi bɛlɛti ra, Yuwifie a xirima yi mɔɔli nan na Darisalamu, e a so mixie yi ra naxee findi si gbɛtɛe ra.»<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Muxu to na mɛ, muxu nun naakae naxa Pɔlu maxandi a naxa te Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />A naxa muxu yaabi, «Munfe ra wo wama n bɔɲɛ maɲaaxufe wo yaye ra? N bara tin e xa n xiri Darisalamu, e xa n faxa, Marigi Isa xili xa fe ra.» <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />A to mu tin muxu xui suxude, muxu mu tin a karaxande. Muxu naxa a fala, «Marigi sago xa raba.»<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Na lɔxɔɛe to dangi, muxu naxa muxu yailan, muxu naxa te Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Isa fɔxirabirɛe ndee Sesarekae naxa muxu mati. E naxa muxu xanin Menason Sipirika xɔnyi, naxan findixi Isa fɔxirabirɛ ra a rakuya. A naxa muxu yigiya.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu Yaki xɛɛbufe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Muxu to so Darisalamu, Isa fɔxirabirɛe naxa muxu rasɛnɛ ɲɛlɛxinyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Na kuye iba, muxu nun Pɔlu naxa siga Yaki xɔnyi. Danxaniyatɔɛ ɲama kuntigi birin naxa e malan naa. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />A to gɛ e xɛɛbude, Pɔlu naxa a xa wali dɛntɛgɛ sa Ala naxan nabaxi si gbɛtɛe tagi a saabui ra. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />E to na mɛ, e naxa Ala matɔxɔ. E naxɛ, «Muxu ngaxakerenyi, i bara a to Yuwifi wulu wuyaxi bara danxaniya, kɔnɔ e man e tunnabɛxixi birafe Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Mixi ndee bara a fala e bɛ a i Yuwifie xaranma, naxee na si gbɛtɛe ya ma, a e xa gbilen Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛe fɔxɔ ra, a e naxa e xa die sunna, a e naxa bira Yuwifie xa naamunyie fɔxɔ ra.»<verse eid="ACT 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />«Won na ma di? Siikɛ yo mu na, ɲama a kolonma nɛ a i bara fa. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Na na a ra, muxu naxan falama i bɛ i xa a raba. Mixi naani na muxu ya ma, naxee bara laayidi tongo Ala bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />I xa kafu e ma, wo birin xa wo yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn, i man xa e sare fi, e xa e xunyi bi. Na na a ra birin a kolonma a mixie naxan falaxi i xun ma, wule na a ra. E xa a kolon i fan biraxi Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ nan fɔxɔ ra. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Muxu naxa natɛ tongo, muxu man fa na sɛbɛ. Danxaniyatɔɛe naxee keli si gbɛtɛe ma, e naxa sube don naxan baxi sɛrɛxɛ ra kuyee bɛ, nun sube yufaxie. E naxa wuli fan min. E man naxa yɛnɛ fan naba.»<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Awa na kuye iba, Pɔlu naxa na mixie tongo, e naxa e yɛtɛ rasɛniyɛn. Na xanbi a naxa so hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, a xa a masen, marasɛniyɛnyi rakamalima lɔxɔɛ naxan ma, a nun sɛrɛxɛ naxan bama kankan bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu safe geeli kui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Na xi solofere raɲɔnyi, Yuwifie Asikae to Pɔlu to hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, e naxa ɲama birin ya iso, e man naxa Pɔlu suxu. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />E nu sɔnxɔɛ rate, «Isirayilakae, wo muxu mali! Na xɛmɛ nan yi ki naxan kawandi ɲaaxi rabama yire birin mixi birin bɛ, Yuwifie, nun Annabi Munsa xa sɛriyɛ, nun yi hɔrɔmɔbanxi xa fe ra. A man bara Girɛkikae raso hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui. Na bara yi yire sɛniyɛnxi findi yire sɛniyɛntare ra.» <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />E na fala nɛ barima e nu bara Pɔlu nun Tirofimo Efɛsɛka to e boore fɔxɔ ra taa kui. E naxa a maɲɔxun a Pɔlu a raso nɛ hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Taa kui birin ya naxa iso. Mixie naxa fa e gi ra keli yire birin. E naxa Pɔlu suxu, e naxa mini a bubu ra tande ma. E naxa naadɛe ragali keren na. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />E nu wama Pɔlu faxafe nɛ. Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa a kolon Darisalamu birin ya isoxi. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa sɔɔrie nun e xa xunmatie tongo, e siga Pɔlu fɔxɔ ra keren na. Ɲama to sɔɔrie to, e naxa ba Pɔlu bɔnbɔfe. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Awa, sɔɔri mangɛ naxa yaamari fi e xa a xiri yɔlɔnxɔnyi firin na. A naxa maxɔrinyi ti fa nde a ra, nun a munfe rabaxi. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Ɲama sɛɛti nde sɔnxɔma e gbe ki, booree fan sɔnxɔma e gbe ki. A to mu nɔ fe fiixɛ sɔtɔde e ra sɔnxɔɛ xa fe ra, a naxa a fala e xa Pɔlu xanin sɔɔri banxi kui. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Pɔlu to ti banxi dɛ ra, sɔɔrie naxa a tongo ɲama xa ɲaaxui ma, <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />barima mixi gali nan nu biraxi e fɔxɔ ra, e nu fa a fala e xui itexi ra, «A xa faxa!»<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu a yɛtɛ xun mafalafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />E wama a rasofe sɔɔri banxi kui tɛmui naxɛ, Pɔlu naxa sɔɔri mangɛ maxɔrin, «I nɔma n sago sade n xa fe nde fala i bɛ?» Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa a yaabi, «I Girɛki xui mɛma? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />I tan xa mu na Misiraka ra, naxan mixie ya iso yi dɔnxɔɛ ra, a naxa suute wulu naani xanin wula kui?» <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Pɔlu naxa a yaabi, «Yuwifi nan n na, Tariseka. Na taa xungbe a munafanyi gbo Silisi bɔxi ma. N sago sa n xa wɔyɛn yi gali bɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Sɔɔri mangɛ to a sago sa, Pɔlu tixi banxi tede dɛ ra, a naxa mixie masabari a bɛlɛxɛ ra. Kuye naxa bolon yen! Pɔlu naxa wɔyɛn Eburu xui.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />«N ngaxakerenyie, n babae, wo xa wo tuli mati n na, n xa n yɛtɛ kan xun mafala.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />E to a mɛ a Eburu xui falama, e naxa dundu dangi singe ra. Pɔlu naxa a fala, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />«Yuwifi nan n na, n barixi Tarise nɛ, Silisi bɔxi ma, kɔnɔ n mɔxi be nɛ. Gamaliyɛli naxa n xaran alako n xa bira won babae xa sɛriyɛ fɔxɔ ra. Ala xa fe nu n bɔɲɛ suxuma alɔ a wo fan suxuma ki naxɛ to. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />N mixie tɔɔrɔ nɛ han n naxa e faxa, naxee nu biraxi Isa xa kira fɔxɔ ra. N naxa ginɛe nun xɛmɛe suxu, n naxa e sa geeli kui. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi nun diinɛ forie birin na n seedee ra. E naxa kɛɛdie so n yi ra katarabi e ngaxakerenyie ma Damasi alako n na danxaniyatɔɛe to, n xa e xiri, n xa fa e ra Darisalamu, n xa e ɲaxankata.»<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />«N to makɔrɛ Damasi ra yanyi tagi, yanbɛ xungbe naxa goro n ma kelife koore ma. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />N naxa bira bɔxi. N naxa xui mɛ naxan nu a falama n bɛ, ‹Sɔlu, Sɔlu, munfe ra i n ɲaxankatama?› <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />N naxa a yaabi, ‹Nde i ra, Marigi?› A naxa n yaabi, ‹Isa Nasarɛtika nan n na, i naxan ɲaxankatafe.› <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Naxee nu na n fɔxɔ ra, e naxa yanbɛ to, kɔnɔ naxan nu wɔyɛnfe, e mu na tan xui mɛ. Awa, n naxa a fala, <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />‹N xa munse raba, Marigi?› Marigi naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹Keli, i siga Damasi. Mɛnni a fama falade i bɛ i lan i xa naxan naba.› <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />N mu nu se toma na yanbɛ xa naiyalanyi saabui ra. Naxee nu na n fɔxɔ ra, e naxa n bɛlɛxɛ rasuxu han Damasi.»<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />«Awa, xɛmɛ nde naxan xili Ananiyasi, mixi tinxinxi na a ra Ala xa sɛriyɛ ki ma, naxan nafanxi Damasi Yuwifie ma, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />a naxa fa n yire. A naxa a fala, ‹N ngaxakerenyi Sɔlu, to ti.› N ya naxa rabi keren na, n naxa se birin to. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />A naxa a fala, ‹Won babae Marigi Ala bara i sugandi i xa a sago kolon, i xa Tinxintɔɛ to, nun i xa a wɔyɛnyi mɛ a tan yati dɛ ra, <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />barima i findima a xa seede nan na mixi birin ya i, i fee naxee toxi nun i naxee mɛxi. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Yakɔsi, i munse mamɛfe? Keli, i xa i xunxa ye xɔɔra, i xa yunubi xa ba i ma, i xa Marigi xili maxandi.›»<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />«N naxa gbilen Darisalamu. N to nu na Ala maxandife hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, n naxa laamatunyi to. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Marigi naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹I xa mini mafuren Darisalamu, barima e mu tinma i xa seedeya ra n ma fe ra.› <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />N naxa a fala, ‹Marigi, e yati a kolon a n nu sigama salidee kui danxaniyatɔɛe fende alako n xa e sa geeli, n man xa e bɔnbɔ. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />E to nu i xa seede Etiyɛn faxama, n tan yati nu na, n nu ɲɛlɛxinxi na ra. N tan nan man nu booree xa dugie suxuxi.› <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Awa, Marigi naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹Siga, n i xɛɛma yire makuye si gbɛtɛe ma.›»<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />E naxa e tuli mati a xa masenyi birin na, han a yi wɔyɛnyi falaxi tɛmui naxɛ. E fa gbelegbele, «Wo yi xɛmɛ faxa. A mu lan a xa balo.» <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />E naxa sɔnxɔɛ rate, e nu e xa donmae rate e ma, e nu xube ite kuye i. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa a fala a e xa Pɔlu raso sɔɔri banxi kui, e man xa a bɔnbɔ luxusinyi ra alako e xa a kolon ɲama sɔnxɔma fe naxan ma.<verse eid="ACT 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />E to nu a xirife alako e xa a bɔnbɔ, Pɔlu naxa sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati maxɔrin naxan nu tixi naa, «Sɛriyɛ na wo yi ra naxan a masenxi a wo xa Rɔmaka bɔnbɔ luxusinyi ra hali a mu makiitixi?» <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunmati to na mɛ, a naxa sa sɔɔri mangɛ rakolon. A naxɛ, «Yi xɛmɛ Rɔmaka lasiri na a ra. Won na ma di?» <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa fa, a naxa Pɔlu maxɔrin, «A fala n bɛ xa Rɔmaka na i ra?» Pɔlu naxa a yaabi, «Iyo xɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Sɔɔri mangɛ man naxa a fala, «N tan naafuli gbegbe nan baxi, n fa findi Rɔmaka lasiri ra.» Pɔlu naxa a fala a bɛ, «N tan barixi lasiriya nan kui nɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Kabi na raba, naxee nu wama a bɔnbɔfe alako a xa wɔyɛn, e birin naxa e magbilen. Sɔɔri mangɛ yɛtɛ naxa gaaxu a kolonfe ra Pɔlu Rɔmaka na a ra, a naxan xiri yɔlɔnxɔnyi ra.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuwifie Pɔlu makiitife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Na kuye iba, sɔɔri mangɛ to wa a kolonfe a fiixɛ ra Yuwifie Pɔlu kalamuxi fe naxan ma, a naxa a fulun. A naxa yaamari fi, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Yuwifi kiitisae birin xa malan. A naxa Pɔlu ragoro, a ti e tagi.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Pɔlu naxa a ya ti Yuwifi kiitisae ra. A naxa a masen, «N ngaxakerenyie, n naxan nabaxi han to, n a rabaxi n bɔɲɛ fiixɛ nan na Ala ya xɔri» <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi, Ananiyasi naxa mixie yaamari, naxee nu na a fɛ ma, e xa a dɛ ragarin. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Awa, Pɔlu naxa a fala a bɛ, «Ala nan fama i tan bɔnbɔde. I luxi nɛ alɔ banxi naxan fari fiixɛ kɔnɔ a kui nɔxɔxi. I bara wa n makiitife kiiti sɛriyɛ ra, kɔnɔ i to yaamari fixi e xa n bɔnbɔ, i bara sɛriyɛ matandi.» <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Naxee nu na a fɛ ma, e naxa a fala a bɛ, «I Ala xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi nan konbima yi ki!» <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Pɔlu naxa a fala, «N ngaxakerenyie, n mu nu a kolon xa sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi na a ra, barima a sɛbɛxi, ‹I naxa wɔyɛn kobi fala ɲama mangɛ bɛ.›»<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Pɔlu to a kolon Sadusenie nun Farisɛnie nu na Yuwifi kiitisae xa malanyi kui, a naxa a fala a xui itexi ra, «N ngaxakerenyie, Farisɛni nan n na. N baba fan Farisɛni nan nu a ra. To n na kiiti banxi barima n laxi a ra Ala fama won nakelide faxɛ ma kiiti lɔxɔɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />A to na fala, boore matandi naxa lu Farisɛnie nun Sadusenie tagi. Ɲama naxa itaxun. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Sadusenie tan bɛ, mixi mu kelima faxɛ ma. E man mu laxi malekɛe nun ɲinnɛe xa fe ra. Kɔnɔ Farisɛnie tan la nee birin xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Sɔnxɔɛ xungbe naxa mini. Sɛriyɛ karamɔxɔ ndee Farisɛnie tagi e naxa wɔyɛn xɔrɔxɔɛ fala. E naxɛ, «Muxu mu fefe ɲaaxi yo rakɔrɔsixi yi xɛmɛ ma. Tɛmunde ɲinnɛ nde, xa na mu a ra malekɛ nde, nan wɔyɛnxi a ra.» <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Sɔnxɔɛ to nu sigama gbo ra, sɔɔri mangɛ naxa gaaxu e fa Pɔlu faxafe. A naxa sɔɔrie ragoro e xa Pɔlu tongo e tagi, e xa a xanin sɔɔri banxi kui.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Na kɔɛ ra, Marigi naxa mini Pɔlu ma. A naxa a fala a bɛ, «I xa limaniya barima i findima n ma seede nan na Rɔma alɔ i a rabaxi Darisalamu ki naxɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">E lanyi xirife Pɔlu faxafe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Kuye to iba, Yuwifie naxa lanyi xiri kali ra, e naxa e dɛge, e naxa e min sinden, a fo e xa Pɔlu faxa. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Naxee na lanyi xiri, e nu dangi mixi tongo naani ra. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />E naxa a masen sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun forie bɛ, «Muxu bara muxu kali Ala ra, muxu mu sese donma sinden fo muxu xa Pɔlu faxa. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Awa, yakɔsi, wo tan nun Yuwifi kiitisae xa mangɛ mayandi a xa fa a ra alako wo xa a xa fe mato a fanyi ra. Na kui, muxu tan a faxama kira ra.»<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Pɔlu maaginɛ xa di naxa na yanfɛ kolon. A naxa siga sɔɔri banxi kui, a naxa na birin masen Pɔlu bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Pɔlu naxa sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati nde xili, a naxɛ, «Yi sɛgɛtala xanin sɔɔri mangɛ xɔn ma, alako a xa fe nde fala a bɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunmati naxa sɛgɛtala tongo, a naxa a xanin sɔɔri mangɛ xɔn ma. A naxɛ, «Pɔlu, geelimani nan n xilixi, a naxa n mayandi a n xa fa yi sɛgɛtala ra i xɔn ma, a xa fe nde masen i bɛ.» <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa sɛgɛtala tongo, e naxa e mamini. Mangɛ naxɛ, «I wama munse falafe n bɛ?» <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />A naxa a yaabi, «Yuwifie bara lan a ma, e xa i maxandi i xa Pɔlu xanin Yuwifi kiitisae yire, alako e man xa maxɔrinyi nde ti a ma. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />I naxa i tuli mati e ra, barima mixi tongo naani nun nde bara yanfɛ xiri a xun e ya ma. E bara e kali a e mu sese donma, e mu sese minma a fo e na Pɔlu faxa tɛmui naxɛ. Yakɔsi e bara gɛ e yailande, e fa i sago nan mamɛfe.» <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa sɛgɛtala rabolo, a naxa tɔnyi dɔxɔ a ma, fa fala, a fe naxan falaxi a bɛ, a naxa na fala mixi yo bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">E Pɔlu xɛɛfe Mangɛ Felisi xɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />A naxa sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati firin xili, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «Wo sɔɔri kɛmɛ firin yailan, sɔɔri soe ragie tongo solofere, nun xali woli kɛmɛ firin. Wo xa e yailan sigafe ra Sesare to kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Wo xa soe nde yailan Pɔlu bɛ, alako a xa mangɛ Felisi li hɛɛri kui.»<verse eid="ACT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Sɔɔri mangɛ naxa yi fe sɛbɛ bataaxɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />«N tan Kilɔdi Lisiya, i tan Mangɛ Felisi mafanxi, n bara i xɛɛbu. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Yi xɛmɛ Yuwifie nan a suxuxi. E naxa wa a faxafe. N to a kolon a Rɔmaka na a ra, n nun sɔɔrie naxa fa, muxu naxa a ba e yi. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />N to wa a kolonfe e a suxuxi naxan ma, n naxa siga a ra e xa kiitisae yire. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />N naxa a li e a kalamuxi e xa sɛriyɛ xa fe nan ma, kɔnɔ a mu fe kobi yo rabaxi a lanma a xa faxa naxan ma, xa na mu a ra a xa sa geeli kui. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />N to bara a mɛ a Yuwifie bara gali malan a xili ma, n naxa a rasanba i ma keren na. N a kalamumae rakolonma e yɛtɛ kan xa sa a kalamu i xɔn a xa fe ra. Wo salamu.»<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Sɔɔrie naxa Pɔlu tongo alɔ e yamarixi ki naxɛ. E naxa a xanin kɔɛ ra han Antipatiri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Na kuye iba, sɔɔrie naxa gbilen sɔɔri banxi. Soe ragie naxa Pɔlu tongo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />E to so Sesare, soe ragie naxa bataaxɛ nun Pɔlu so mangɛ yi ra. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mangɛ to gɛ bataaxɛ xarande, a naxa Pɔlu maxɔrin a keli dɛnnaxɛ. A to bara a mɛ a Silisika na a ra, a naxa a fala, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />«N fama nɛ i makiitide i tɔɔɲɛgɛlae na fa tɛmui naxɛ.» A naxa yaamari fi e xa Pɔlu xanin geeli banxi Herode naxan tixi.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Felisi kiiti safe Pɔlu xa fe ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Xi suuli dangi xanbi, Ananiyasi, naxan findixi sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi ra, nun forie naxa fa e nun xunmafalɛ nde, naxan xili Teritulo. E naxa Pɔlu kalamu mangɛ xɔn ma. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />E to Pɔlu xili, Teritulo naxa so a tɔɔɲɛgɛfe yi masenyi ra.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">«Felisi mangɛ fanyi, yi bɔxi birin dɔxɔxi bɔɲɛsa kui i xa fe kolonyi nun i xa xaxili fanyi nan saabui ra. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />I bara muxu rasɛɛwa hɛɛri xungbe ra. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />N mu wama i rabufe, kɔnɔ n bara i maxandi i xa i tuli mati muxu xa masenyi ra dondoronti. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Muxu bara a to yi xɛmɛ mixi ɲaaxi na a ra. A Yuwifie tagi isoma naxee na duniɲa birin. A tan nan na Isa Nasarɛtika xa ɲama xunyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />A man naxa wa hɔrɔmɔbanxi maberefe. Muxu naxa a suxu. Muxu naxa wa a makiitife muxu xa sɛriyɛ ki ma, <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />kɔnɔ sɔɔri mangɛ Lisiya naxa fa, a naxa a ba muxu yi sɛnbɛ xungbe ra. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />A naxa a kalamulae yaamari e xa fa i xɔn ma. Xa i fan Pɔlu maxɔrin, i fama a kolonde muxu a suxuxi fe naxan ma.» <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Yuwifie naxa tin na masenyi ra, e fan naxa a fala a na na ki nɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Mangɛ naxa Pɔlu yaamari a fan xa wɔyɛn. Pɔlu naxa a masen a bɛ, «N a kolon, yi bɔxi makiitima nan i ra kabi ɲɛ wuyaxi. Na kui, n nan ma fe xunmafalama nɛ i bɛ lanlanteya kui. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Xi fu nun firin mu dangi kabi n naxa siga Darisalamu salide. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />E mu nu muxu nun mixi li sɔnxɔ ra hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, xa na mu a ra salide xunxurie kui. N mu sɔnxɔɛ ratexi taa kui, n mu gali kui isoxi. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />E mu nɔma sese masende, e n kalamuma naxan ma. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />N naxan masenma i bɛ na nan ya. N nan n benbae Marigi Ala nan batuma alɔ Isa xa kira a masenxi ki naxɛ, e a falama kira naxan bɛ a wule kira. Naxan sɛbɛxi Tawureta Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa Kitaabui kui, n la na birin na. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />N laxi Ala xa masenyi ra naxan masenxi a tinxintɔɛe nun tinxintare birin fama nɛ kelide faxɛ ma. Yuwifie fan laxi na ra. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Na nan a toxi n nan n yɛtɛ karaxanma alako n xa n ma simaya radangi bɔɲɛ fiixɛ kui Ala nun mixie tagi. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />N mu nu na be ɲɛ wuyaxi bun ma, kɔnɔ yakɔsi n faxi harige nde ra n bɔnsɔɛ bɛ. N fan faxi sɛrɛxɛ bade Ala bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />E n lixi na tɛmui nɛ hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, n sɛniyɛnxi, gali mu na n fɔxɔ ra, sɔnxɔɛ yo fan mu keli n saabui ra. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifi nde naxee keli Asi bɔxi ma, e mu tin n ma fe ra. E tan xa e yɛtɛ masen i bɛ, xa fe nde na e bɛ n ma fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Xa na mu a ra naxee na be, e xa a masen i bɛ e n toxi fe ɲaaxi naxan xun, n to siga Yuwifi kiitisae yire. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />N wɔyɛnyi naxan falaxi e tagi na nan ya: ‹Wo n makiitima nɛ to barima n laxi a ra Ala fama nɛ mixi faxaxie rakelide.›»<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felisi naxan nu Isa xa kira kolon a fanyi ra, a naxa e xa fe sa sinden. A naxɛ, «Mangɛ Lisiya na fa, n wo xa fe matoma.» <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />A naxa sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati yamari a xa Pɔlu kanta, a naxa a tɔɔrɔ, a man naxa a xa mixi yo ratɔn fe fanyi rabafe ra a bɛ.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Xi ndee to dangi, Felisi nun a xa ginɛ Dirusila, naxan na Yuwifi ra, e naxa fa. Felisi naxa Pɔlu xili kawandi rabade Isa Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi xa fe ra. Pɔlu naxa danxaniya xa fe fala e bɛ Isa ma, <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />kɔnɔ a xa masenyi to nu binyaxi tinxinyi ma, nun yɛtɛ xurufe ma, nun Ala xa kiiti naxan fama, Felisi naxa gaaxu. A naxɛ, «Siga sinden. N na n yɛtɛ masɔtɔ tɛmui naxɛ, n man i xilima.» <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />A man nu waxi nɛ Pɔlu xa kɔbiri fi a ma. A nu a xilima na nan ma tɛmui birin, e xa sa e bore to.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Ɲɛ firin to dangi, Felisi masarama naxa fa, Pɔrusu Fɛsitu. Felisi to wa a yɛtɛ mafanfe Yuwifie bɛ, a naxa Pɔlu lu geeli kui.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Fɛsitu Pɔlu makiitife</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Fɛsitu naxa xi saxan naba Sesare. Na xanbi, a naxa te Darisalamu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigi nun Yuwifi kuntigie naxa Pɔlu kalamu Fɛsitu bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />E naxa Fɛsitu mayandi a xa fa a ra Darisalamu. E nu wama nɛ e xa a faxa kira ra. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fɛsitu naxa e yaabi, «Pɔlu makantaxi Sesare. A gbegbe mu luxi n tan fan xa siga naa. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Wo xa yarerati ndee xa n mati, wo xa Pɔlu kalamu naa xa a bara sa fe ɲaaxi nde raba.»<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fɛsitu mu se sa xi solomasaxan fari, xa na mu a ra xi fu Darisalamu, a naxa goro Sesare. Na kuye iba, a naxa dɔxɔ a xa kiiti kibanyi ma. A naxa yaamari fi e xa fa Pɔlu ra. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />A to fa, Yuwifie naxee fa keli Darisalamu, e naxa a rabilin. E naxa tɔɔɲɛgɛ gbegbe sa a xun, e mu nu nɔma naxan masende nɔndi ra. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Pɔlu naxa so a yɛtɛ xunmafalafe, a nu a fala, «N mu fe ɲaaxi yo rabaxi Yuwifie xa sɛriyɛ ra, xa na mu hɔrɔmɔbanxi ra, xa na mu a ra Rɔma mangɛ ra.» <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Fɛsitu to wa a yɛtɛ mafanfe Yuwifie xɔn, a naxa Pɔlu maxɔrin, «I wama tefe Darisalamu i xa sa makiiti yi fee ma n ya xɔri?» <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Pɔlu naxa a yaabi, «N lanma n xa makiiti mangasanyi xa kiiti banxi nan kui, n tixi dɛnnaxɛ yi ki. N mu fe kobi yo rabaxi Yuwifie ra. I fan na kolon a fanyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Xa n bara fe ɲaaxi raba a lanma n xa faxa naxan ma, n mu tondima n xa faxa, kɔnɔ xa e naxan falama wule na a ra, a mu lan mixi yo xa n so e yi ra. Mangɛ xungbe xa sa n makiiti Rɔma.» <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Fɛsitu to wɔyɛn a rasimae ra, a naxa a fala Pɔlu bɛ, «I bara wa sigafe mangɛ xungbe xɔn. Awa, i sigama nɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu masenfe Agiripa nun Berinisi bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Xi nde to dangi, mangɛ Agiripa nun Berinisi naxa so Sesare Fɛsitu xɛɛbude. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />E to bara xi wuyaxi radangi naa, Fɛsitu naxa Pɔlu xa fe fala mangɛ Agiripa bɛ. A naxɛ, «Felisi bara geelimani nde lu be. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />N nu na Darisalamu tɛmui naxɛ, sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie nun Yuwifie forie naxa a kalamu, e man naxa wa a xa faxa. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />N naxa e yaabi a Rɔmakae xa sɛriyɛ mu mixi faxama, fo a xa a gbe fala kalamusae bɛ kiitisa ya xɔri. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Na fe nan e rafaxi be. N fan mu dugundi. Na kuye iba, n naxa dɔxɔ n ma kiiti banxi. N naxa yaamari fi e xa fa na xɛmɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Kalamusae to e dɛntɛgɛ, e mu fe ɲaaxi yo fala a xun ma, n nu naxee maɲɔxunxi. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />E nu xɔrɔxɔma e xa diinɛ nan ma fe ra, a nun Isa xa fe ra. E naxɛ a bara faxa, kɔnɔ Pɔlu naxɛ a baloxi. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Awa, n to mu a kolon a lan n xa naxan naba, n naxa a maxɔrin xa a wama sigafe Darisalamu, a xa makiiti naa. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Kɔnɔ Pɔlu naxa wa a xa fe xaninfe mangɛ xungbe xɔn ma. Na tɛmui n naxa yaamari fi e xa a kanta han n a rasanbama mangɛ xungbe ma tɛmui naxɛ.»<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agiripa naxa a fala Fɛsitu bɛ, «N fan wama n tuli matife na xɛmɛ ra.» Fɛsitu naxa a yaabi, «Tina, i a xui mɛma.» <verse eid="ACT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Awa, na kuye iba, Agiripa nun Berinisi naxa so malan yire e nun taa kuntigie. E nu maxirixi a fanyi ra. Fɛsitu xa yaamari ma, e naxa fa Pɔlu ra. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fɛsitu naxa a fala, «Mangɛ Agiripa nun wo tan naxee birin na be, wo bara yi xɛmɛ to Yuwifi naxan birin kalamuxi n xɔn Darisalamu nun be. E naxɛ a a xa faxa. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />N tan bɛ, a mu fefe rabaxi a lan a xa faxa naxan ma, kɔnɔ a tan yati bara mayandi ti sigafe ra mangɛ xungbe xɔnyi Rɔma. Awa, n fan bara tin na ra. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />N mu fe xɔri yo sɔtɔxi naxan sɛbɛma mangɛ xungbe ma a xa fe ra. Na na a ra, n a raminixi wo ya i, a gbengbenyi i tan mangɛ Agiripa, alako won na gɛ a maxɔrinde n xa a kolon a lanma n xa naxan sɛbɛ. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />N mu nɔma geelimani rasanbade mangɛ ma, n mu a masen a naxan nabaxi.»<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Pɔlu a yɛtɛ xun mafalafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Agiripa naxa a fala Pɔlu bɛ, «I xa i yɛtɛ xun mafala.» Pɔlu to a bɛlɛxɛ ite, a naxa a yɛtɛ rafiixɛ yi masenyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />«Mangɛ Agiripa, to n ɲɛlɛxinxi n ma fe rafiixɛfe ra Yuwifie n kalamuxi naxan ma. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />I e xa diinɛ nun e xa sɛriyɛ kolon ki fanyi ra. Awa yandi, i xa i tuli mati n na. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Kabi n dimɛdi tɛmui, n nu na Darisalamu n bɔnsɔɛ ya ma. Yuwifi birin n ɲɛrɛ ki kolon <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />a rakuya. E man a kolon Farisɛni nan nu n na diinɛla tagi naxee xa fe maxɔrɔxɔ. E nɔma na seedeɲɔxɔya bade. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Yakɔsi, e n nakiitife barima n laxi Ala xa laayidi ra a naxan tongoxi muxu benbae bɛ, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />muxu bɔnsɔɛ fu nun firinyi naxan mamɛfe. E Ala batuma tɛmui birin, kɔɛ nun yanyi. N laxi na laayidi nan na. Mangɛ, Yuwifie n kalamuxi na nan ma. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Wo nɔma lade a ra a Ala mixi faxaxie rakelima?»<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />«N tan kata nɛ kira mɔɔli birin na n xa Isa Nasarɛtika xili kana. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />N na nan naba Darisalamu. Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie naxa tin n xa sɛniyɛntɔɛ wuyaxi sa geeli kui. N man naxa tin e xa faxa. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />N nu sigama salide banxie kui alako n xa e tɔɔrɔ, e xa gbilen e xa danxaniya fɔxɔ ra. N ma xɔnɛ kui, n nu e tɔɔrɔ hali taa gbɛtɛe kui.»<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />«Sɛrɛxɛdubɛ kuntigie naxa tin n xa siga Damasi na fe ma. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Mangɛ, yanyi tagi n naxa yanbɛ to kira xɔn ma kelife koore, n tan nun n booree rabilinyi. A yanbɛ nu dangi soge ra. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Muxu naxa bira bɔxi ma. N naxa xui nde mɛ naxan nu a falama n bɛ Eburu xui, ‹Sɔlu, Sɔlu, munfe ra i n ɲaxankatama? Na fe xɔrɔxɔma nɛ i bɛ.› <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />N naxa a yaabi, ‹Marigi, nde i ra?› Marigi naxa n yaabi, ‹Isa nan n na, i naxan ɲaxankatafe. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Keli, ti i sanyie xun na. N minixi nɛ i ma alako n xa i findi walikɛ nun seede ra fee ma i naxee toxi nun i fama naxee tode. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />N i ratangama nɛ Yuwifie ma nun si gbɛtɛe ma, n i xɛɛma naxee ma, alako i xa e yae rabi, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />e xa mini dimi kui, e xa so naiyalanyi kui. E xa keli Sentanɛ xa nɔɛ bun, e xa so Ala xa mangɛya niini bun ma. Na kui, e xa yunubi xafarima nɛ, e man fama nɛ kɛ sɔtɔde sɛniyɛntɔɛe ya ma naxee danxaniyaxi n ma.›»<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />«Na kui, mangɛ Agiripa, n mu tondi na xɛɛraya ra naxan keli koore ma. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />N naxa na kawandi ti Damasi, Darisalamu, Yudaya, nun si gbɛtɛe tagi. N naxa a masen e bɛ e xa tuubi, e xa danxaniya Ala ma, nun e xa wali fanyi raba naxan e xa togondiya masenma.»<verse eid="ACT 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />«Yuwifie naxa n suxu hɔrɔmɔbanxi kui, e waxi n faxafe na nan ma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Kɔnɔ, Ala tantu, n baloxi a tan nan saabui ra han to. N naxa na seedeɲɔxɔya ba dimɛe nun forie birin bɛ. N mu fefe gbɛtɛ falaxi fo namiɲɔnmɛe nun Annabi Munsa nu naxee falama a e fama nɛ rabade. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />E naxa a masen Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi tɔɔrɔma nɛ, a singe nan kelima faxamixie ya ma, a nun a Yuwifie nun si gbɛtɛe kawandima kisi ra.»<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />A to nu wɔyɛnfe a yɛtɛ rafiixɛfe ra, Fɛsitu naxa a fala a xui itexi ra, «Pɔlu, i daxu! I xa fe gbegbe kolonyi bara i findi daxui ra.» <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Pɔlu naxa a yaabi, «Fɛsitu mafanxi, daxui mu na n na. N nɔndi nun lɔnni nan masenfe. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mangɛ Agiripa tan yi fee kolon. N yi birin falama a tan nan bɛ, barima a ɲan a kolon, a a mu raba gundo xa kui.» <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Pɔlu naxa a fala Agiripa bɛ, «Mangɛ Agiripa, i laxi namiɲɔnmɛe ra? I la e ra, n na kolon.»<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agiripa naxa a fala Pɔlu bɛ, «A gbe mu luxi i xa n fan findi Isayanka ra!» <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Pɔlu naxa a yaabi, «A fa findi yakɔsi ra, xa na mu tɛmui gbɛtɛ, n Marigi maxandima nɛ alako i tan yo, a nun naxan birin n xui ramɛfe be to, wo fan xa lu alɔ n tan, ba yi yɔlɔnxɔnyi ra naxan na n ma.»<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Mangɛ Agiripa, mangɛ Fɛsitu, Berinisi, nun naxee birin nu dɔxɔxi e sɛɛti ma, e naxa keli. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />E to nu sigama, e naxa a fala e bore bɛ, «Yi xɛmɛ mu fefe rabaxi a lanma a xa faxa naxan ma, xa na mu a ra a lanma a xa sa geeli kui naxan ma.» <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agiripa naxa a fala Fɛsitu bɛ, «Yi xɛmɛ nu lan a xa bɛɲin, kɔnɔ a bara maxandi ti Mangɛ Xungbe xa a makiiti.»<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Pɔlu sigafe Rɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />E to natɛ tongo muxu xa baki kunkui kui sigafe ra Itali, e naxa Pɔlu nun geelimani ndee so sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati yi ra naxan xili Yuliyusi, naxan na mangɛ xungbe xa sɔɔrie ya ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Muxu nun Arisitaraki, naxan keli Tɛsaloniki Masedon bɔxi ma, naxa baki kunkui kui naxan keli Adiramiti. A nu lan a xa dangi Asi sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Na kuye iba, muxu naxa kilɔn Sidɔn. Yuliyusi, naxan nu a ɲɔxɔ saxi Pɔlu xɔn ma a fanyi ra, a naxa a sago sa a xa siga a booree xɔnyi biyaasi fandɛ fende. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Muxu to keli naa, muxu naxa dangi Sipiri suri ma, barima foye mu nu tinxi muxu bɛ. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Muxu to Silisi nun Panfiliya baa igiri, muxu naxa so Mira, Lisi bɔxi ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Mɛnni, sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati naxa kunkui to naxan keli Alesandire, a sigafe Itali. Muxu naxa baki na kui.<verse eid="ACT 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Xi wuyaxi bun ma kunkui nu tɔɔrɔma ɲɛrɛde. Kata nun kata muxu fa Sinidi li kɔnɔ foye mu tin muxu xa kilɔn naa. Na nan a to muxu naxa dangi Kirɛti suri laabe ra, Salemone sɛɛti ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Naa iɲɛrɛfe nu xɔrɔxɔ. Muxu naxa yire nde li, naxan xili Wafu Tofanyi, Laseya fɛ ma.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Muxu naxa bu naa. Ɲɛrɛ man nu xɔrɔxɔ barima sunyi tɛmui nu bara dangi. <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />Na na a ra, Pɔlu naxa a fala, «N biyaasibooree, n bara a kolon won ma ɲɛrɛ fama nɛ xɔrɔxɔde. Kotee, kunkui, nun mixie fama nɛ tɔɔrɔde.» <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Sɔɔri kɛmɛ xunmati naxa a tuli mati kɛpini nun kunkui kanyi xa wɔyɛnyi ra, a tondi Pɔlu xa marasi ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Mixi gbegbe naxa wa Feniki life, barima e nu na wafu dɛnnaxɛ, mɛnni mu nu fan ɲɛmɛ radangide ra. Feniki, Kirɛti suri wafu nan a ra, naxan ya rafindixi sogegorode biri ma. E naxa wa e xa ɲɛmɛ radangi naa.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Foye di nde naxa mini keli kɔɔla ma. E naxa a maɲɔxun a biyaasi bara fan. E naxa hanga bɛndun, e kunkui radangi Kirɛti suri fɛ ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Kɔnɔ na tɛmui foye xungbe, naxan xili Yurakilɔn, a naxa fa keli suri ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Foye naxa kunkui tutun, han kunkui mu nu nɔma matinxinde. Muxu naxa muxu raxara foye yi ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Muxu naxa dangi suri lanmadi laabe ra, naxan xili Kiloda. Muxu naxa tɔɔrɔ kunkui lanma masɔtɔfe ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />E to gɛ a ratede, e naxa luuti mafilin kunkui ma. E to nu gaaxuxi dɔxɔfe ra Sirite bɛnki ma, e naxa bɛla ragoro, foye nu fa siga muxu ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Foye naxa muxu bɔnbɔ a fanyi ra. Na kuye iba, muxu naxa kote nde woli baa ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Xi saxan to dangi, muxu yati naxa kunkui isee birin nagoro ye ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Xi wuyaxi naxa dangi, soge mu na, tunbuie mu na, foye sɛnbɛ nu gboma nan tui. Muxu mu nu laxi muxu kisife ra sɔnɔn.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Kabi xi wuyaxi muxu mu nu donse donma. Awa Pɔlu naxa ti mixie tagi, a naxa a fala e bɛ, «N booree, xa wo wo tuli mati n na nu, won mu kelima Kirɛti nu, won mu yi kasarɛ nun lɔsi sɔtɔma nu. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Kɔnɔ yakɔsi, n wo rasima nɛ, wo xa limaniya, barima mixi yo mu faxama wo ya ma, kunkui nan gbansan kasarama. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />N Marigi Ala, n walima naxan bɛ, a xa malekɛ nde bara mini n ma yi kɔɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />A naxa a fala n bɛ, ‹Pɔlu, i naxa gaaxu, fo i xa ti nɛ mangɛ xungbe ya i. Ala bara tin i biyaasiboore birin natangade.› <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Na na a ra, wo xa limaniya barima n laxi Ala xa masenyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Won fama suri nde lide.»<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Kɔɛ fu nun naani nde, muxu naxa Adiriyatike baa li. Na kɔɛ tagi kunkui raɲɛrɛ naxa sogi a muxu bara makɔrɛ bɔxi nde ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />E to ye tilinyi maniyase ragoro, e naxa kanke ya mɔxɔɲɛn sɔtɔ. E to makuya dondoronti, e man naxa a ragoro, e naxa kanke ya fu nun suuli sɔtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />E to gaaxu garinde fanye nde ra, e naxa hanga naani woli kunkui xanbi ra. E naxa gbata kuye ibafe ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Kɔnɔ kunkui raɲɛrɛe nu wama kelife kunkui xun. E naxa kunkui lanma ragoro baa ma alɔ e na hangae nan nagorofe kunkui ya ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Pɔlu naxa a fala sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati nun sɔɔrie bɛ, «Xa yi mixie mu lu kunkui kui, wo mu nɔma kiside.» <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Awa, sɔɔrie naxa kunkui lanma luuti bolon, e naxa a rabɛɲin a xa siga.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Beenun kuye xa iba, Pɔlu naxa e birin nasi e xa donse don. A naxa a fala e bɛ, «A xi fu nun naani nan to wo mamɛ tife, wo mu tinxi wo dɛgede. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />N bara wo rasi wo xa donse don, barima na nan fan wo fate bɛ. Mixi yo mu halakima, hali wo xunsɛxɛ keren mu lɔɛma.» <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />A to na fala, a naxa taami tongo, a Ala nuwali sa e birin ya xɔri, a taami igira, a naxa a don fɔlɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Na tɛmui e birin naxa limaniya, e fan naxa so taami donfe. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Muxu mixi kɛmɛ firin mixi tongo solofere a nun senni nan nu na kunkui kui. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />E to wasa donse ra, e naxa farin woli baa ma alako kunkui xa yelebu.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Kuye to iba, e mu a kolon e na dɛnnaxɛ, kɔnɔ e naxa bɔxi nde to. E naxa natɛ tongo e xa kata kunkui rasigade naa. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />E naxa hangae fulun, e xa sin baa ma. E naxa fɛya luutie fan bolon. E naxa yare bɛla rate, e xa e xun sa xare ma. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Kɔnɔ e naxa bɛnki li, kunkui naxa kankan. Kunkui xunyi to kankan, mɔrɔnyi naxa a xɔrɛ kana sɛnbɛ ra. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Sɔɔrie naxa lan geelimanie faxafe ma, alako e naxa ye masa, e e gi. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Kɔnɔ sɔɔrie kɛmɛ xunmati, naxan nu wama Pɔlu rakisife, a naxa e ratɔn. A naxa yaamari fi e ma a naxee fata ye masade, e singe xa bagan ye ma alako e xa xare masɔtɔ. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Booree xa gbaku xebenyie ra, xa na mu a ra kunkui xuntunyie ra. E birin naxa xare masɔtɔ hɛɛri kui.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Pɔlu Malita suri life</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Muxu to xare masɔtɔ, muxu naxa a kolon a na suri xili Malita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Malitakae naxa sɛɛwa muxu ra ki fanyi ra. E naxa muxu birin malan tɛ xungbe fɛ ma, e nu naxan xuruxi, barima tunɛ nu fafe nun xinbeli gbegbe ra. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Pɔlu to bolee matongo safe tɛ i, bɔximase naxa mini na tɛ wuyenyi xa fe ra, a naxa a bɛlɛxɛ xin. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Malitakae to bɔximase to, a bara a bɛlɛxɛ xin a singanxi a ra, e naxa a fala e bore bɛ, «Nɔndi ra, niba nan yi mixi ra, barima haakɛ mu tinxi a xa balo, hali a to tangaxi baa ma.» <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Pɔlu naxa bɔximase ralisan tɛ, sese mu a to. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Na mixie nu mamɛ tife nɛ a xinde xa funtu, xa na mu a ra a xa faxa keren na, kɔnɔ sese mu a to. E to mamɛ ti, e naxa e xa maɲɔxunyi masara. E naxa a fala ala nde nan a ra.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Suri kuntigi xungbe, naxan xili Pubiliyu, naxa muxu yigiya a fanyi ra a xɔnyi xi saxan bun ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Pubiliyu baba nu saxi, a furaxi, mangafaxɛ nu na a ma. Pɔlu to a makɔrɛ a ra, a naxa a bɛlɛxɛ sa a ma, a Ala maxandi, a naxa a rayalan. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Na xanbi, suri furema gbɛtɛe naxa fa, Pɔlu naxa e fan nayalan. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />E naxa muxu binya a fanyi ra. Muxu to keli sigade, e naxa fandɛ fi muxu ma.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔlu Sigafe Rɔma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Muxu to kike saxan nadangi naa, muxu naxa baki kunkui kui, naxan keli Alesandire. A nu bara ɲɛmɛ radangi suri ma. Tɔnxuma nu a ma naxan findixi kuye masolixi firinyi ra. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Muxu to so kilɔn Sirakusi, muxu naxa lu naa xi saxan. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Muxu to keli naa, muxu naxa siga Regiyo baa dɛ ra. Foye to keli yirefanyi ma na kuye iba, muxu naxa xi firin ɲɛrɛ raba han Pusoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Muxu naxa ngaxakerenyie li naa naxee muxu mayandi xi solofere radangife ra e xɔnyi. Na tɛmui muxu siga nɛ han Rɔma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Muxu ngaxakerenyi Rɔmakae, naxee muxu xa fe mɛ, e naxa fa muxu ralande, keli Rɔma han Apiyusi malan yire nun taa naxan xili Banxi Saxanyie. Pɔlu to e to a naxa Ala nuwali sa, a naxa limaniya.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Muxu to so Rɔma, sɔɔri mixi kɛmɛ xunmati naxa geelimanie so mangɛ yi ra, kɔnɔ a naxa Pɔlu lu a kerenyi ma, a nun sɔɔri keren naxan a kantama. <verse eid="ACT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Xi saxan to dangi, Pɔlu naxa Yuwifi kuntigie xili. E to malan, a naxa yi wɔyɛnyi ti e bɛ, «N ngaxakerenyie, hali n to mu fefe rabaxi won ma mixie ra, nun won benbae xa naamunyie ra, Yuwifie bara n sa geeli kui Darisalamu, na xanbi e man fa n so Rɔmakae yi ra. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />E to gɛ n maxɔrinde, e nu wama n nabolofe nɛ, barima e mu sese toxi n faxama naxan ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Kɔnɔ Yuwifie mu tin. Na ma, n naxa mangɛ xungbe xa kiiti maxandi, kɔnɔ n mu wa n bɔnsɔɛ nan kalamufe. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Na na a ra, n naxa wa wo tofe alako n xa wɔyɛn wo ra, barima Isirayilakae xaxili tixi xɛɛra naxan na, na xa fe nan a toxi e yi yɔlɔnxɔnyi saxi n ma.»<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />E naxa a yaabi, «Muxu mu bataaxɛ yo sɔtɔxi i xa fe ra keli Yudaya. Won ngaxakerenyi yo mu faxi fe ɲaaxi falade i xa fe ra. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Kɔnɔ, muxu wama a kolonfe nɛ i naxan maɲɔxunxi, barima muxu a kolon e yi diinɛ xa fe ibaxantinma yire birin.»<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Pɔlu naxa lɔxɔɛ keren so e yi. Mixi wuyaxi to fa a xɔnyi, Pɔlu naxa Ala xa mangɛya seedeɲɔxɔya ba. A naxa Isa xa fe masen e bɛ Tawureta Munsa nun namiɲɔnmɛe xa Kitaabui saabui ra keli gɛɛsɛgɛ han nunmare. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Ndee naxa la a ra, kɔnɔ booree mu danxaniya. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />E to nu fatanma lantareya kui, Pɔlu naxa yi masenyi sa a fari, «Ala Xaxili Sɛniyɛnxi a fala nɛ wo benbae bɛ nɔndi ki ma Annabi Esayi saabui ra. A naxɛ,<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />‹Siga yi mixie xɔn ma, i xa a fala e bɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">“Wo a mɛma wo tulie ra, kɔnɔ wo mu a fahaamuma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Wo a toma wo yae ra, kɔnɔ wo mu a igbɛma.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Barima yi mixie sondonyi bara xɔrɔxɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">E bara e tulie dɛsɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">E bara e yae raxi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">alako e naxa a to e yae ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">e naxa a mɛ e tulie ra,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">e naxa a fahaamu e xaxili ra.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Xa na mu a ra e e sondonyi mafindima nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">alako Ala xa e rayalan.›»<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />«Awa, wo xa a kolon a Ala xa kisi bara rasanba si gbɛtɛe ma. E fama e tuli matide a ra.» <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />A to na fala, Yuwifie naxa siga xɔrɔxɔɛ kui e booree tagi.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Pɔlu naxa lu banxi nde kui ɲɛ firin, a nu a sare fi. Naxee birin nu fama a tode, a nu e birin nasɛnɛma. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />A nu Ala xa mangɛya niini xa fe nan kawandima a nun Marigi Isa xa fe, Ala xa Mixi Sugandixi. A naxa na birin naba limaniya ra, mixi yo mu a tɔɔrɔ.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>